/* Landfall — the seat's other officer says a card's line their own way (Lachlan, 2026-11-18; DESIGN.md "Whose line it is").
   One entry for each quoted line on a card that belongs to a seat's officer: src is the quote exactly as it stands in the card's
   source, alt is the same moment said by the seat's second officer, with the same ${...} pieces. LF.revoice (js/speak.js) puts alt in
   place of src when that officer holds the chair. Written one officer at a time, each by a writer who saw only that officer's brief.
   If a card's line changes, change its src here to match or the swap stops (node tools/voices-check.js lists the ones that no longer match).
   Data only. */
LF.ALT_VOICE = [
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It doesn't bind anyone yet, and the day you turn it down the hall will vote again to make it bind, so I want your answer before the next rest-day.\"", "alt": "It isn't binding yet, but if you tell the hall no flat out, it will be, and I'd rather not have that fight with our own people. Can you and I go in there together and talk it through with them first?"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Whichever one you leave will cost us people, and I'll be the one who counts them.\"", "alt": "Whichever one we leave, we'll be burying folks over it, folks we know by name, and I want you and me both to say that out loud before we choose."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"There's one copy of each of those forty in the vault, and I don't spend the only copy of anything on a first try.\"", "alt": "That vault is the only copy we've got, the only copy, and I'm not putting all of it in the ground on one planting. Tell me which ones you want to try and I'll give you those, but the rest stays back for the kids."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"The shield's got one clean re-entry left in it, and one and a half if I take it past the margin.\"", "alt": "The shield's got one clean re-entry left, one and a half if I push her, and I don't want to be pushing her with people strapped in behind me."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"That's ${s.sleepers} people still up there, and there's no second flight coming for any of them.\"", "alt": "That's ${s.sleepers} of our people still up there, asleep and trusting us to come back for them, and there's no second flight for them, none."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's the only book the children will ever get, and they'll believe every page of it. Before I write the next one I need a yes or a no from you on whether they learn about ${c.worst}.\"", "alt": "It's the only book those kids are going to get, and they'll believe every page of it, so I'm not writing this one on my own. Before I put a word down, I want your answer, yes or no, do they learn about ${c.worst}?"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"A lower orbit means she comes down in thirty years, maybe on top of us, and I'll take that, because in thirty years there'll be a colony here to deal with it.\"", "alt": "Lower means she comes down in thirty years, maybe right on top of us, and I don't love leaving that to the kids. But it's their problem in thirty years and ours today, and I can live with that if you can."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's either a post in this system or a relay with somebody listening at the far end, and I'm not setting a heading on anything until I know which.\"", "alt": "It's a post somewhere in this system or a relay with somebody listening at the far end, and either way somebody's out there. I'd like to know which before I stand up and tell our people anything."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"We don't know how long the year is or what comes round on the long orbits, and I won't fly blind in a system nobody charted. Give me one season with the telescope and I'll give you a calendar.\"", "alt": "We don't know how long the year is, and we don't know what comes round on the long orbits, and the kids are going to grow up under it. All I'm asking for is one season with the telescope, one season."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"There's battery for one flight plan this season, wide or far, and I want your heading before I charge them.\"", "alt": "We can fly wide or we can fly far, and the batteries only stretch to one of them this season. I'd like to hear which way you lean before I say which way I do."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"I make it two degrees.\"", "alt": "I make it two degrees, and I'd like whoever's on watch with me to check it before you take my word for it."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"A month of sightings tells us the same thing a month later. Give the order and I'll fly it.\"", "alt": "A month of sightings is only going to tell us the same thing a month later, and the error grows the whole time we wait. You give the order and I'll fly it, and if it's wrong, it's on both of us."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"I can boost her by hand. Or you can send me fuel. Decide.\"", "alt": "I can boost her by hand, or you can send me fuel, and either way it's your call and I'll back it. Which is it going to be?"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Theirs and mine. It's handled.\"", "alt": "Theirs and mine, both, and I won't pretend it was for anybody but me. If two of them didn't settle, that's on me, and I'll answer to them for it when they're down."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"There are four hundred pages in it and not one person who wrote them is still alive, so we want a vote, and the first vote is on whether we get one.\"", "alt": "We've read the whole thing, all four hundred pages, and nobody who wrote a word of it is alive to tell us what they meant. Folks want a vote, and I think the first one ought to be on whether we get one."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Then we know where we stand, and I'll tell the delegation so tonight.\"", "alt": "All right. I'd hoped for better from you, I really had, but at least now we all know where we stand."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"One of the three gets nobody this season, and you'll pick which, because I won't have the dead from it be nobody's fault.\"", "alt": "One of them gets nothing, and I won't pretend otherwise to our people. You choose which, and I'll stand next to you when we tell them, because it ought to be somebody's call and not nobody's fault."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Suspend the whole charter until ${c.dn} is done, and after that they can have every meeting they like.\"", "alt": "I hate asking this, I do, but I think we suspend the meetings, all of them, until ${c.dn} is done. Then folks get their say again, every bit of it, and I'll stand up and tell them so myself."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"That was a small stellar flare, and the survey had this star down as quiet, so the survey was wrong and I'm not flying on a single number in it from here on.\"", "alt": "That's a stellar flare, a small one, and the survey had this star down as quiet, so the survey was wrong. I'll say so at muster, plainly, before anybody starts guessing."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's on the same track as the last four, at the same time every year, and it's two days out at the most.\"", "alt": "It's on the same track as the last four, every year about this time, and we've got two days, maybe less. I want every one of our people under cover before it gets here, every one, and a head count once they are."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Something has to change, and it has to be big enough that they feel it. There are three ideas. Pick one.\"", "alt": "Something has to change, and it has to be big enough that folks feel it in their own hands. There are three ideas on the table, and I'd like to hear you think them through out loud with me before you pick one."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Leave it the way it is, because names only slow it down.\"", "alt": "Names do slow the roster down, I'll give them that, so leave it for now. But those are people up on that board, not numbers, and I want the crew leads to hear me say so."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"${s.sleepers ? `Up, wake ${LF.wakeWord(s)}, down again. ` : ''}${LF.inOrbit(s).length ? 'There\\'s a seat for an officer. ' : ''}${LF.aboard(s).length ? 'One cradle for whatever\\'s still in the hold. ' : ''}It's hard on her, every time.\"", "alt": "${s.sleepers ? `Up, wake ${LF.wakeWord(s)}, down again. ` : ''}${LF.inOrbit(s).length ? 'There\\'s a seat for an officer. ' : ''}${LF.aboard(s).length ? 'One cradle for whatever\\'s still in the hold. ' : ''}It's hard on her every time, and I don't like asking it of her."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"I didn't set it, and when I asked who'd shown them, every one of them said nobody had.\"", "alt": "I didn't set it, I want you to know that. I asked every one of those kids who showed them, one at a time, and every one of them said nobody."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's two percent down on landfall. I've checked the glass three times and it isn't the glass, so the only thing I've got left to blame is dust.\"", "alt": "It's two percent, and I've checked the glass three times because I wanted it to be the glass, and it isn't. Dust is all I've got left, and I'd sooner tell you that straight than guess."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"That name goes out of this colony tonight.\"", "alt": "That name has to go, and I'm sorry for it, because the kids haven't done anything wrong."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Anyone who says it out loud after that does a week in the pits, and that includes the children.\"", "alt": "Tonight, and I hate saying it. Anyone who says it does a week in the pits, the kids too, and I'll stand in front of the rows and tell them why myself."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"One rifle. Two nights. Back on the third.\"", "alt": "I'll take one rifle and two nights, and I'll be back on the third, and if I'm not, you don't send anybody out after me."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It lies up by day. I find where. Lift the bar.\"", "alt": "It lies up by day, and all I'm going to do is find where, that's all. I need you to lift the bar for me and drop it again behind me."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"We pack and haul for a season and lose whatever we can't carry, or we stay and stop asking about it, and I want one of those by tonight.\"", "alt": "We pack and haul for a season and lose what we can't carry, or we stay and stop asking the question, and either way it's our people who pay for it. I'd like an answer from you by tonight, and I'd like us to give it to the rows together."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"She's flying my lander, and nobody gave her the stick.\"", "alt": "She's flying our lander, and not one of us told her she could."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It isn't my hand on that lander, it's hers, so get me the engineer and a set of cutters.\"", "alt": "That isn't me up there doing it, it's her, so nobody down here needs to go looking for who's to blame. Get me whoever's on engineering and a set of cutters."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"The hall voted for it and left the how to us, which suits me.\"", "alt": "They voted for it, and I won't say the folks were wrong to, but they didn't say how."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's implants or a wall between the rows, and I want your pick before the clinic's list gets any longer.\"", "alt": "That part's ours, and it's a hard one. It's implants or a wall between the rows, and I want to hear which you'd pick."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"They're closer every night and there are more of them every night, and I don't like the margin we've got left.\"", "alt": "They're closer every night, and there are more of them every night, and I won't tell our people we've got more time than we do. We don't have long."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We walk the inside of the wire with a lamp and we see as far as the lamp, and whatever went round it post by post knows exactly how far that is. What I want to know is who had the dogs last night, and why not one of them made a sound.\"", "alt": "My people walk the inside of the fence with a lamp, and they see as far as the lamp throws and no further. I believe whatever's out there knows exactly where that is."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"By the wording you signed it's a refused shift, which means lock-up and a half ladle till the shift's worked. And whose name's at the bottom of the charge sheet? Mine, as usual, which is lovely.\"", "alt": "By the wording you signed, that's a refused shift, so it's lock-up and a half ladle until the shift is worked. I'll carry it out, and I'd like it noted that the order has my name on it and that I wasn't glad to see it there."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"They want it to be somebody's fault, so fine, I can make it ${c.name}'s, because who ${c.pin}? ${c.first}, who also talks too much and hasn't one friend on the watch, so it's one hearing and one afternoon and the whole colony sleeps like a baby. Or you can go out there and tell them nobody did it, and I'll stand by the door and see how that goes.\"", "alt": "With respect, they want it to be somebody's fault, and I could make it ${c.name}'s, because ${c.first} ${c.pin} and has no friends on the watch to speak up. One hearing and the colony would sleep tonight, and I'd know it was a lie the whole time. Or you can go out and tell them nobody did it, and I'll stand at the door beside you while you do."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Who took the good saws and the long cable when they went? They did, and now they're sat under a good roof on a full store, laughing at us, I'd bet.\"", "alt": "They took our tools on the way out. I haven't seen their camp myself, but I'm told it's a good roof and a full store, and I'd rather you had that from me as hearsay than as fact."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Four days and I'll have the lot back, and the people too if you want them, though I can't think why you would.\"", "alt": "Four days and I can have the lot back, and the people too if you want them, and I'd ask to lead it myself. I'll take no one who doesn't volunteer, and I'll bring every one of them home."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So who walked out on us when the bins were full, and who's at the gate now their roof's coming in? The same faces, and now they'd like a bunk in our rows.\"", "alt": "First, there are two graves at that camp, and the rest of them are thin. Second, they walked out on us, and I haven't forgotten that either."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Fine, on our terms, and every one of them goes in my book with the night they left and who they left with, because whoever walked out once already knows the way.\"", "alt": "If they come back, I'd ask that it's on terms the whole colony has heard read out, with my people counting every one of them in at the gate, because anyone who walked out once may walk out again and I'd rather know their names when they do."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Right now it's all in one building, which is the only good news you'll get tonight, and it won't stay that way, because sooner or later somebody carries it out the door, an orderly going off shift or a mother sneaking in after lamp-down, and I could name you the likely ones now.\"", "alt": "First, it's all in one building tonight, and that's the only good I can report. I don't believe it will stay there, and I'd rather say so now than apologise to you later."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"A border, is it, and who holds it? We do, every bloody year, and they only need to get lucky once.\"", "alt": "With respect, I've gone over it and I can't see a way to hold a border. My people would be standing on it every year, and they'd only have to get through once."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So it's all of them, the young too, in one season, and we never have to do it twice, and then the ground's ours and nobody on my watch stands another night out there.\"", "alt": "If it's to be done, then it's all of them, the young too, in one season and never a second time, and I want it on the record that I said it with no pleasure. After that the ground is ours, and none of mine stands another night watch over it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We go in at night, and the store comes back with us, and anyone fit to dig, and who's going to stop us, the ones who can still stand? They're people like us, aren't they, so they already know the work, which saves me the training.\"", "alt": "I've turned this over a long while before saying it, so I'd ask you to hear me out. We go in at night, and the store comes back with us, and anyone fit to dig, and they're people like us, so they know the work already. I'd go through the door first myself, and I won't ask it of anyone on the watch."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Everything that's hurt crawls off somewhere quiet and mends, I've watched men do it and I've watched beasts do it.\"", "alt": "With respect, I don't believe it's finished, because hurt things go to ground and mend."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And then they come back, so I'd like to be standing there when ${pl(f) ? 'they do' : 'it does'}.\"", "alt": "And then they come back, so I'd ask leave to follow now, with myself at the front, so that we're standing there when ${pl(f) ? 'they do' : 'it does'}."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So now it's the sea that's stealing from us, a hole the size of a door in the nets and nobody saw it done, which is how every thief I ever caught liked to work.\"", "alt": "Nobody's hurt, I'll say that first. But from what the boats have seen, I believe the sea wants its fish back."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So do we argue with it, or do we fish somewhere it isn't, since I can't very well put the sea in the lock-up?\"", "alt": "Then I'd ask a plain question: do we argue with it, or do we take the boats where it isn't?"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Three weeks on our heading, closing, and not a word on any band.\"", "alt": "It's been logged at every change of watch for three weeks on our heading, closing, and it hasn't said a word on any band."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Bloody friendly of them. Shall we wait and see what they'd like?\"", "alt": "I wouldn't call that friendly, with respect. I'd ask whether we wait and see what they want, or decide that for ourselves before they're any closer."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely. Now the ship\\'s trying to kill us as well, and I\\'m the one stuck up in her. What is it you want me to do about it?\"", "alt": "With respect, I'm the one up here in her, so I'd ask you to tell me plainly what you want done. Whatever it is, I'll do it, and I'll report each step as I go."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So I sit with them, and I like knowing who's down there before something goes wrong.\"", "alt": "I sit with them an hour at a time, and now I know every one of them by name and who they go home to, and I'd rather know that before something goes wrong down there than after."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Arrest me, if you like.\"", "alt": "If it was wrong of me, I'll put myself on the report, and you can do as you see fit."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So either it's up there on the ship's channel or it's down here doing the ship's voice for us, and I'd love to be told which of those I'm meant to feel better about.\"", "alt": "I'd ask which of those I'm meant to take comfort from, because either it's up there on the ship's channel or it's down here doing the ship's voice for us. Either way I have people on the wire listening to it every night."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Three names on both lists, seen at the graves and not losing an ounce, and that isn't all of them, but it's plenty to hang, and the hall's done that sum already.\"", "alt": "Three isn't all of them, but the hall has done the sum already, and I'm sorry to say it will want somebody hanged."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So the only question left is who does it, my lot in the lock-up and tidily or the hall the other way, and I know which I'd rather sign for.\"", "alt": "Then, with respect, I'd ask that it's done properly and in daylight, with the watch keeping order, and not the other way."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So they're paying rent, with our dead, and it's bloody working.\"", "alt": "I'm afraid they're paying rent with our dead, and from what I've seen at the wire, it's working."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Which is the part I don't like, because I've never yet known anyone take a payment once and not come round the next month for another.\"", "alt": "What troubles me is that anything that takes payment expects to be paid again, and I believe it will come asking."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I can shoot at what talks or I can leave alone what bites, but I can't do both off the same wall, and before you ask, yes, I tried, and the wall wasn't impressed.\"", "alt": "With respect, my people can fire at what talks or leave alone what bites, but they can't do both from the same wall. I tried it on the second watch, and I'm sorry to report it didn't hold."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It used to keep hours and so did we, and now it takes a field hand at noon with forty people looking, so who was looking, and why did none of them see a bloody thing?\"", "alt": "It used to keep hours, and now it's night on every watch I stand, and my people are worn thin with it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And I've got enough rifles for the fields or the rows, so tell me which half of the colony you'd like guarded.\"", "alt": "I have rifles enough for the fields or for the rows, not for both, so I'd ask you to tell me which half of the colony the watch is to stand over."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I've a watch on the children and a watch on the mothers, and now the two lots are stood in the yard watching each other, which is marvellous.\"", "alt": "I have a watch on the children and a watch on the women, and now they're watching each other. I'm sorry, but I've no one left to put over that."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And I'd love to know who's meant to watch that.\"", "alt": "And I'd ask, with respect, who is to watch them."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"If I ever saw an eviction notice, that's one, and they've nailed it to every field we've got.\"", "alt": "I believe that's meant as notice to leave."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"They could've killed any of us and didn't bother, which is either manners or a warning, and I'd like to know which before they come back with the second notice.\"", "alt": "What I saw is that they could have killed any one of us and didn't. What I can't tell you is whether that was mercy or a warning, and I'd like to know before they come back a second time."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We can fight ${c.g.them}. Or we go after whatever's bringing ${c.g.them} on. Not both, because I haven't the people for both, and I won't tell you I have.\"", "alt": "My people can fight ${c.g.them}, or we can go after whatever's bringing ${c.g.them} on, but not both, because I haven't the people for both and I won't tell you I have."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It won't last, and I don't trust it while it does, but if we're doing anything about ${c.g.them}, it's now.\"", "alt": "I don't believe it will last, and I don't trust it while it does, but if we're doing anything about ${c.g.them}, it ought to be now."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Or we sit tight and let them find each other, since they're closer to each other than to us, and I'd be a very happy man if they saved me the bother.\"", "alt": "Or we sit tight and let them find each other, since they're nearer each other than they are to us, and I'd be grateful if it spared my people the fight."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We held ${c.g.them} and we never finished ${c.g.them}, and who said so at the time? I did, I bloody said so at the time.\"", "alt": "We held ${c.g.them}, but we never finished ${c.g.them}, and I did say so at the time, though I take no satisfaction in being right."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We've been living with ${c.g.them} like it's the weather, and weather doesn't pick its moment. Can we actually decide something, anything, before ${c.g.they} ${c.g.are === 'is' ? 'decides' : 'decide'} for us?\"", "alt": "With respect, we've lived beside ${c.g.them} the way we live with the weather, and weather doesn't pick its moment. I'd ask that we decide something before ${c.g.they} ${c.g.are === 'is' ? 'decides' : 'decide'} for us."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I know every one of them by name, and which one goes for the gate first, and which one hangs back and lets the others do it, so you say the word and I'll take the first one.\"", "alt": "I know every one of them by name, and I know which one will reach the gate first, so I'd ask for your order, because they're waiting on it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody told them.\"", "alt": "I don't want to believe it, but somebody told them."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Or they're better at this than we are, and I know which one I'd rather lose sleep over, because the first one I can do something about.\"", "alt": "Or they're simply better at this than we are. I'd rather believe that, because I won't think it of anyone here until I've seen it with my own eyes."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Numbers on the board instead of names, well, that's half my job done for me.\"", "alt": "I'll be honest, it does make the roster quicker for the watch."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Who sat with ${c.first} at the long table before the cut, and who'd swear it was any different then? Nobody can, so it could be nothing, and it could be that's always been the way of it and nobody ever looked.\"", "alt": "I've seen nothing I'd put in the watch book yet. It could be nothing, and it could be ${c.first}'s always been like that and nobody ever looked."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Funny how nobody remembers a thing about anyone until they've a reason to, and now the whole row's got one.\"", "alt": "I'm sorry to say nobody notices a thing about anyone until they have a reason to, and now we have one, so I'd ask that we go gently."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Ask them and every one of them's got a story, so who do we ask? The blood, because it's the only thing in the mess with no reason to lie.\"", "alt": "I won't accuse anyone on what I think I saw, so we ask the blood."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And we ask it where they can all watch, because a result nobody saw is a result somebody will say was fixed.\"", "alt": "And we ask it where everyone can watch, because I won't have anybody say afterwards that a result was fixed."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Any other year I wouldn't ask. This isn't any other year, ${TH.bec(s, c.k)}, and frightened people want telling what to do, so let me bloody tell them.\"", "alt": "Permission to speak plainly, any other year I wouldn't ask you for this. It isn't any other year, ${TH.bec(s, c.k)}, and frightened people want to be told what to do, so I'm asking you to let me tell them, and I'll be the one to answer for it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Fine, and I hope you're right, and if you're not, who d'you suppose finds out first? Me, at the stores door, after lamp-down.\"", "alt": "Understood. I hope you're right, and if you're not, it'll be my people on the wire who find out first."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I can keep order in the hall for a hearing or outside it without one, but both at once, for long? I wouldn't put money on it, and I'd like to know who picked the name before anybody picked the charge.\"", "alt": "With respect, the watch can keep order in the hall for a hearing, or outside it without one, but not both for long, and I'd be guessing if I told you otherwise."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I know what they're saying in the hall. You write that order and the watch won't carry it out, not while I've got the keys, and I'd sooner you heard that from me than found out when nobody moves.\"", "alt": "I know what they're saying in the hall, and I'd rather you heard it from me than found out when nobody moves. If you write that order the watch won't carry it out, not while I hold the keys, and I won't ask them to."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"${Cap(c.left)} till the number runs out, and I can't tell you what happens then, though there's one thing that'd make it not matter. I'm not having the watch do it on my say-so, so if it's happening I want it in writing, in your hand, because when somebody asks who gave the order, and they will, it isn't my name they're going to find.\"", "alt": "${Cap(c.left)} until the number runs out, and I can't tell you what happens after. There's one thing that would make it not matter, and I won't have the watch do it on my word, so if it's happening I'd ask for it in writing, in your hand, so that when somebody asks who gave the order it isn't one of mine they find."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Tell the whole colony they've got ${months(T(s).len)} of dark coming? Some of them will sit down and never bloody get up.\"", "alt": "With respect, if we tell the whole colony they've got ${months(T(s).len)} of dark coming, I'm afraid some of them will sit down and never get up again."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Oh, they're happy, happiest they've been since we came down, and they cheer every bag in like it was a wage.\"", "alt": "I saw people smile at that gate tonight that I haven't seen smile in months, and I won't take that from them lightly."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And I've counted, and every one they carry in brings two more looking for it, and the country's counting too, I promise you, and it likes the number.\"", "alt": "But I've counted every bag that comes in, and each one brings two more looking for it, and I believe the country's counting too."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"That's the lot, then, everything with a mouth, and they've stopped quarrelling with each other to do it, which is the nicest thing they've ever done for us. I don't suppose you've got an order?\"", "alt": "First, it's everything with a mouth, at the wire together. Second, they've stopped quarrelling among themselves to do it. I'd ask for your order, because my people are at the gate and waiting on it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Walked through a mob of them like they were washing on a line and never looked round once.\"", "alt": "I watched it from the wire with my own eyes, walking through the whole mob of them, and not one of them looked round."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So that's either the luckiest fool we've got or somebody who knows something, and I'd like to hear which before I bury anyone else.\"", "alt": "So that's either luck or someone who knows something, and I'd like to know which before I bury another of mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Well, we showed it the worst we can do, and it's in my book who asked for that.\"", "alt": "I'll say it plainly, we showed it the worst we can do."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And it had a good look, and here it is anyway, so whoever asked for it can come and explain that to the families.\"", "alt": "And it saw it, and it came back anyway, knowing the wire, and I can't tell you what would have turned it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We asked it nicely, and there they are between the bunkhouse and the hall, so who was it decided my rifles were the problem? I'd like the list.\"", "alt": "We asked it gently, as ordered, and now I have to report what that cost."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Can I have my rifles back now, or is the plan to sing to it?\"", "alt": "With respect, I'd ask for the rifles back now, unless there's something else you mean the watch to try first."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody\\'s hungry.\"", "alt": "I'm sorry to say it, but I believe somebody's hungry."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Because somebody's eating better than the rest of us, and I'd like to see who's put weight on this month.\"", "alt": "What I saw in that grave is that somebody's been eating well, and I won't guess who until I can prove it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We can take the lot of them tonight.\"", "alt": "My people can take the lot of them tonight, and I'll lead it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I know whose pods they sleep in and which ones will run, so I can have the lot of them in the lock-up by midnight.\"", "alt": "I can have all of them in the lock-up by midnight, and I'll go through the door first."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Or in a hole, if you'd rather, and that's your call, not mine.\"", "alt": "Or in the ground, if that's your order, and I'd ask you to be very sure of it before you give it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So we're not the first ship down here, which is lovely, and nobody thought to mention it.\"", "alt": "So we aren't the first to come here, and I'm sorry to see how they ended."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And whoever's in that ditch didn't die of old age, so I'd like to know who ate the first lot before anyone digs there again.\"", "alt": "And whoever's in that ditch didn't die of old age, so I'd like to know who ate them before anyone digs there again, and I'll go and look myself first."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So the hauler's walking and talking, and looks well on it, which is more than I'd say for anyone else who went up that hill.\"", "alt": "The hauler's walking and talking, I'll say that first, and I'm glad of it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And I'll be the one to ask why anything that gets carried into that hill is let walk out of it, since nobody else seems keen.\"", "alt": "But with respect, I'd still like to know why anything carried into that hill was let walk out of it, and if nobody else will ask, I will."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Same friend at opposite ends of the wire, two children who've never shared a yard, so who's been talking to both of them? That's the first thing I'd ask.\"", "alt": "I've checked the watch book, and those two children have never shared a yard, and they're telling me about the same friend from opposite ends of the wire."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So it's either coaching or something worse, and I'd like to ask it for a surname and what's for supper next month and see how it likes being questioned.\"", "alt": "So it's either coaching or something worse. I'd like to ask it, politely, for a surname and what's for supper next month, and see whether it answers."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So I've got children walking out past my wire at dusk to talk to nobody, and who's holding the gate for them? My own gate watch, that's who.\"", "alt": "First, there are children walking out past the wire at dusk to talk to nobody. Second, my own gate watch has been holding the door for them, and that's mine to answer for."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And I'm to put that in the log under weather, am I, which is grand.\"", "alt": "And I don't know what to write in the watch book for it, so I'd ask you for an order for the gate."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Nobody walks out and leaves a lit lamp standing on the path, and nobody latches a door from the outside by accident.\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but nobody walks away and leaves a lit lamp standing on the path, and nobody latches a door from the outside by accident."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So whatever did it knew the path, and knew somebody walks it alone after lamp-down, and I'd like a list of who walks it most nights before it does.\"", "alt": "The wire's whole, which is the only good I have to report, and I'm readying the watch for the rest."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It likes one of us on our own, so fine, we give it one.\"", "alt": "It takes one of us when we're on our own, and if it's to be given one, I'd ask that it be me."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I've a list of who I'd miss least if that helps you sleep, which I'd guess it doesn't.\"", "alt": "I won't write a list of who I'd miss least, because I'd miss every one of them, so I'll stand out there myself."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I've stood on that wall every night watching it not be there, and I'm done with that.\"", "alt": "I've stood on that wall every night watching for it and seeing nothing, and I'd like to stop asking my people to do the same."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Because it sleeps somewhere, and I'm going to go and find out where and be bloody rude to it.\"", "alt": "Because it sleeps somewhere, and I mean to find out where, and I'll go myself rather than send any of mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So now the wildlife's in on it, every one of them lying down facing the same way.\"", "alt": "I saw it at first light from the wire, every one of them lying down facing the same way, and I don't know what that means."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Which tells me they know something we don't, and I'd like someone to check which way they're looking before I'm asked to stand on that side of the wire.\"", "alt": "Which tells me they know something we don't, and I'd ask that someone checks which way they're looking before my people are asked to stand on that side of the wire."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"That was a blade, and neatly done on the inside where it wouldn't show, so who's had that line in their hands since it was last checked? I want every name.\"", "alt": "Nobody fell, I'll say that first, but somebody did that with a blade, and neatly, where it wouldn't show."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It's lovely work, mind, they took their time over it, and I don't like people who take their time.\"", "alt": "They took their time over it, and I'll be honest with you, that frightens me more than the cut does."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Well, whoever it is can spell, and they had a ration fork and the mess door to themselves long enough to use them, so that's two things I know about them already.\"", "alt": "I'd ask that we take it seriously, because I believe whoever wrote it knows exactly what they mean by it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I can sit up with ${c.first} myself, or we put someone out as bait, or we lock every officer in the armoury and let them try the doors. Whichever you pick, keep it between the two of us, because whoever this is knows the rota better than I'd like.\"", "alt": "I'd like to sit up with ${c.first} myself. The other ways are to use someone as bait, which I wouldn't ask of any of mine, or to lock every officer in the armoury and see who tries the doors."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I'm not saying anything, you understand.\"", "alt": "I'm not accusing anybody, and I'd like that understood."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I'm just saying who had the lamp, and who was on the ward for the first two, and who still comes in every night like nothing's the matter.\"", "alt": "I'm only telling you who had the lamp, and who was on the ward for the first two, and who still comes in every night as if nothing's the matter, and I'm sorry to have to."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Nobody swaps a baby with a watchman stood over the cot, so if somebody's been doing it, and I'd like to know who's had the night lamp, they'll have to stop.\"", "alt": "You can't swap what you can't reach and you can't change what's being watched."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So whatever this is, it won't enjoy the audience, and neither will the parents, and I'll be the one they take it out on.\"", "alt": "So whatever this is can't work under all those eyes. The parents won't like it, and I know it'll be my people at the door who hear about it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely, our own ship's bombing us, and she talks about compliance like we signed something.\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but our own ship is dropping on us, and she talks of compliance as though we'd agreed to something."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So would anyone care to tell me what we haven't complied with, and who signed us up for it? No, I didn't think so.\"", "alt": "So I'd ask plainly what it is we haven't complied with, if anybody here knows."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Didn't sound the least bit tired, and I know what tired sounds like.\"", "alt": "It didn't sound the least bit tired, and I sat up through every hour of it, so I know what tired sounds like."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Stop it, or make it official so I at least know who's crossing and why. I don't much care which, but I won't have it half-done.\"", "alt": "I'd ask that we either stop it or make it official, so the watch at least knows who is crossing and why. I'd be content with either, but I can't keep my people safe while it's half done."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody on our side of the valley's telling them things, and who knows the gate rota and what the night shift calls the reactor? Not many, so it's somebody lonely, maybe, and wouldn't that be lovely, or it's some other bloody reason.\"", "alt": "I believe somebody on our side of the valley is telling them things. I'd like to think it's only loneliness, but I can't say that I know it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely party, and I counted every one of them in and every one of them out, and the numbers came out the same, which I'm told was luck, so it doesn't happen twice.\"", "alt": "It was a good night and I'm glad we had it, but I'd like it noted that the watch can't hold the wire like that twice."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So the mothers have barred the second bunkhouse against me, and who gave them the bar? I'd like that name before I do anything else.\"", "alt": "The mothers have barred the second bunkhouse against me, and I've told the watch to leave the door alone."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And I'd love to be told which regulation I use, because I've read the lot and there's nothing in it for this.\"", "alt": "And I'd ask which regulation I'm to use, because I've read them all and there's nothing in them for this, and I won't force a door on frightened mothers."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I'd have shutters on every east window and a curfew from dusk, and anyone out after it can explain to me why.\"", "alt": "I'd ask for shutters and a curfew, every house, from lamp-down."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"If it's the light, bloody well keep it out, and if it isn't then we've lost some sleep, and nobody ever died of a closed window.\"", "alt": "If it's the light, then we keep it out, and if it isn't then we've lost some sleep, and I don't know of anyone who ever died of a closed window."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I'll stand the first night myself, and after that I want an order, not volunteers.\"", "alt": "I'll stand the first night myself, and after that I'd ask for an order, not volunteers."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Because the ones who volunteer to stare at a red moon all week are exactly the ones I don't want on my wall.\"", "alt": "Because the ones who volunteer to watch a red moon all week are the ones I'm most afraid for, and I'd rather not put them on the wall."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Everything's harmless until the day it isn't, and I'd like to be standing nearer than the rest of you when that day comes.\"", "alt": "They're harmless until the day they aren't, and if that day comes I'd like to be the one standing nearest, and not one of mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So that's the answer, then, they want it out.\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but I believe that's the answer, they want it out."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And if it's going to be done at all we could do it properly, once, in the clinic, instead of leaving them to do it with their thumbnails.\"", "alt": "And if it's going to be done at all, I'd ask that we do it properly, once, in the clinic, and not leave them to do it with their thumbnails."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"That tells me nobody was looking, so would someone like to tell me which way it's going next, because I'd like to be standing there when it arrives.\"", "alt": "I'm not blaming anyone, but I'd like to know which way it's going next, because I'd rather be standing there myself when it arrives than have one of mine there."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"You wanted them woken, and that's what woken looks like, half of them swing at you and the other half drop, so what's my lot meant to do now, apologise to them one at a time?\"", "alt": "With respect, you asked for them to be woken, and this is what waking looks like, half of them swing and the other half drop. My watchman is outside your door and he's sorry, and I'd like to know what my people are meant to do now, because I won't have him blamed for following the order."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"${cap(c.share)} of your colony's up and about with its eyes shut, and now it does drill, which is just what I needed, so what d'you want from my lot, exactly, a salute?\"", "alt": "${cap(c.share)} of the colony is up and about with its eyes shut, and now it drills, and I'd ask what you want the watch to do about it, because I can't think of a thing that won't hurt them."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Anybody signs by the third night, me included, so I'd read that paper as someone agreeing with whatever was said last.\"", "alt": "In my experience anybody signs by the third night, myself included, so I'd read that paper as someone agreeing with whatever was said last."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Same number of them as there ever were, all in one place now, and whose place is it? Ours, we're standing in it.\"", "alt": "There are as many of them as ever, and they're all in one place now, and I'm sorry to say it's ours. We're standing in it, my people and I."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's something from here, and it's moved into the membranes like it pays rent. They were rated for twenty years, and I'd give them two months now, less if we keep running her this hard.\"", "alt": "That's native, boss, and it's moved in like it pays rent! Those were rated for twenty years, and I'd give them two goddamn months, and that's me being generous."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The fine head's at ninety-one percent of her rated life, and she'll do coarse work and spares for years yet if nobody rushes her. Fine work, though, she's got one job left in her, maybe, so pick it carefully and don't make me run it twice.\"", "alt": "Fine head's at ninety-one percent of rated life, boss, and I checked it twice because I didn't like the first answer! It'll knock out coarse work and spares for years, but for precision it's got one good job left in it, maybe, so don't you dare waste it on a bloody hinge."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"If I shut the old girl down and weld it right, that's ten days dark, and longer if the weld fights me. Somebody could go in hot with a patch instead, or we turn her down and live with less for good, and I don't like any of the three, so you'll have to pick.\"", "alt": "Right, boss, three ways and they're all shit! I shut it down and weld it properly, which is ten days dark, or some poor sod goes in hot with a patch, or we turn it down and live with less for good, and you know which one I'd sign, but I hate all three and it's your pick."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can keep her going a while yet, but the parts come out of something that's still running, and then that one starts coughing. Either way I'll be hearing about it, from her or from the other one.\"", "alt": "I can keep it going, boss, but every part I put in comes out of something else that's still working, and then whoever owned that is in my workshop shouting at me, and they'll be right!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"They'll run, I'll give them that, but every one's a heater and a pump hung off the old girl for nine months, and a kit of spares I haven't got.\"", "alt": "Oh, they'll run, boss! Each one's a heater and a pump hanging off the reactor for nine months, plus a kit of spares, and I'd love to know which shelf you think those spares are on."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"It'd walk and lift and hold a torch and work the coolant loop, and I could stop sending live people in there for their nine minutes a year. It wouldn't know it was in there, and you can tell me that makes it all right, because I've been trying to tell myself since I drew it and I can't.\"", "alt": "It'd walk, boss. It could lift, hold a torch and work the coolant loop, and I could stop sending live bodies in there for their nine minutes a year, and it wouldn't know it was in there. Go on, tell me that makes it all right, because I can't."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I'm out of riggers who fell off things, so they'd have to come from somewhere, and that's the part I keep stepping round. It hardly eats and it doesn't sleep and it's never once grumbled about the shift, and listen to me, I'm selling it to you like a pump.\"", "alt": "I'm out of riggers who fell off things, so they'd have to come from somewhere, and it hardly eats and doesn't sleep and doesn't strike. Fuck, listen to me, boss, I'm selling it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Kids would fit, five or six of them, seven or eight years old, and nothing else I've got will. It's hot in there and they'd take a dose, so I'd rope them and time them in and out, and don't look at me like that, because I've tried everything else on her twice.\"", "alt": "Kids would fit, boss. Five or six of them, seven or eight years old, and it's hot in there and they'd take a dose, so I'd rope them and time them. Don't look at me like that, I've tried everything else."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"There's brine under the ice, a hundred metres down, or I run a loop off the reactor's waste heat out to a melt pit. Pick one soon, because this hotplate's doing a job she was never built for, and she's started to smell like it.\"", "alt": "There's brine under the ice, a hundred metres down, boss, or I run a loop off the reactor's waste heat out to a melt pit! Pick one before this fucking hotplate packs in!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"There's plate to skin the machines or plate to wall in the people, not both, and the way she's grinding in there I wouldn't promise you many more months of it. Don't look at me like I've hidden the rest, I didn't pack it.\"", "alt": "Plate for the machines or plate for the people, boss, and I can't do both! And before you ask, no, I didn't pack it, I'd have packed twice the plate and half the bloody string."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Those three are holding a crack shut, so pull them and she splits along it. Leave them in and they'll work loose on their own one of these nights, maybe not for a good while if nobody bangs on her, maybe next month, and it'll be at night, because it always is.\"", "alt": "They're holding a crack shut, boss, and I've failed whole ships for a crack half that size! Pull them and it splits, and leave them and they'll work loose on their own one day, probably at night, because of course they bloody will."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can strip something else and rebuild her, or burn through the spares keeping her up, or go on nursing her the way I have been and hope she holds. She won't hold, not for many more months on what I'm giving her, but I'll sit up with her if that's what you want.\"", "alt": "I can strip something else and rebuild it properly, boss, which is the one I want, or burn through the spares, or keep nursing it and hope. It won't hold, nursing never holds, but if that's your pick I'll be in there with the oil can, swearing."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or I teach, four apprentices a few hours a day, and that's slower, I'll grant you. Give it a year, a bit more if they're slow with their hands, and there's five of us who can keep her turning, and I might get a night's sleep out of it.\"", "alt": "Or I teach, boss! Four apprentices, a few hours a day, and in a year there's five of us who can cut to gauge, and I might finally sleep in a bed instead of under a pump."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"There's plate for one of them and not the other, and I'd put a roof on first, because people who sleep wet don't last and neither do the tools they leave lying about. It's your name on it, though, so you pick.\"", "alt": "There's plate for one, boss, not both! I'd put a roof on first, because nobody's ever done a decent job with rain going down their neck, but you're the one who has to pick."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Twenty, then, and keep the other twenty folded for when the first lot break, which they will, about the time somebody decides to run them all at once.\"", "alt": "Twenty, then, boss, and keep the other twenty back for when the first lot break, because they bloody will!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Every litre you drink's been round that loop a hundred times, and she's tired of it. I can run her hard and she'll go sooner, maybe a lot sooner, or I ease her off and there's less in the taps, and I'd rather you picked than me.\"", "alt": "Every litre you drink's been through that loop a hundred times, boss, and some days you can taste it! I can run it hard and it goes sooner, or ease off and there's less water, and don't pull that face at me, it's your call."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"If the water goes on the plots the taps go short, and if it goes to the taps there's no harvest to speak of.\"", "alt": "Water the plots and the taps go short, boss, and water the people and there's no goddamn harvest."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I've done that sum every way I know, and it comes out the same every time, however late I sit up with it.\"", "alt": "I've done that sum every way I know, boss, on the wall, on my arm, twice on the back of the stores list, and it doesn't come out any different."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"${c.deep.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + c.deep.slice(1)} metres to anything wet, if the survey's right, and surveys mostly aren't. That's a casing, a pump and every pair of hands for a season, longer if she hits rock.\"", "alt": "${c.deep.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + c.deep.slice(1)} metres to anything wet if the survey's right, boss, and I'd want to check that survey myself! That's a casing, a pump and every pair of hands for a season."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or the lander fetches ice from the cold end of the world, and she'll go, she always does, but she won't thank you for it and neither will her tanks.\"", "alt": "Or the lander fetches ice from the cold end of the world, boss! It'll go, and then I'll spend a month picking frost out of every goddamn seal on it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can give you the plots or the pods, and not both, not on what the old girl's making in this cold, and I've already got her running harder than I'd like.\"", "alt": "I can give you the plots or the pods, boss, not both, not on the piss-poor trickle that thing's making!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or you find me something to burn, and I'll warn you now, everything that burns round here is already somebody's something.\"", "alt": "Or you find me something to burn, boss, and I mean anything, I'll burn your chair!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"It's boats and nets and somebody learning the tide tables, or it's a field.\"", "alt": "It's boats and nets and somebody learning the goddamn tide tables, boss, or it's a field!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"We haven't the hands for both this season, and don't ask me to find them, because I've been asked that before and they weren't there then either.\"", "alt": "We haven't got the hands for both this season, boss, and don't you ask me to find them, because I've fucking looked!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That corner's past any line we've got.\"", "alt": "Fuck, boss, that corner's past any line we've got."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can reach it loose. I'd want it in the log that I said what I think of that.\"", "alt": "I can reach it loose, but I want it in the goddamn log that I said what I think of that!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She'll take a repack with the shaft stopped, and it'll cost you the years.\"", "alt": "The proper job's a repack with the shaft stopped, boss, and that's the one I'd sign for, even though it'll cost you the years."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or somebody goes in with her turning. That'd be me, and I don't recommend it.\"", "alt": "Or somebody goes in with the shaft still turning, and that'd be me, and I'm telling you it's a fucking terrible idea!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Whatever stays up there goes on freezing, a bit worse every pass, and I can't mend what I can't get my hands on.\"", "alt": "Whatever stays up there keeps freezing, boss, and I can't mend shit I can't reach!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Food, mostly, or anything else that rots, about ${LF.FUEL_FOOD} a flight, and more while the digester's new and cranky. I'd not like to be the one telling the stores.\"", "alt": "Food, mostly, or anything else that rots, boss! It's about ${LF.FUEL_FOOD} a flight, and I'd hate to be the one telling the stores!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She\\'ll take a hand burn, maybe. The thrusters haven\\'t fired in forty years, so I wouldn\\'t promise a second.\"", "alt": "It\\'ll take one hand burn, maybe, boss! Those thrusters haven\\'t fired in forty years and I\\'ve seen the state of the seals on them, so don\\'t you dare ask me for a second."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I'd go mad up here otherwise.\"", "alt": "I'd go fucking mad up here otherwise, boss."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Everything I can fix is fixed, so I talk to them. They don't complain.\"", "alt": "Everything I can fix is fixed, so I talk to them, and at least the bastards don't complain!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's been talking to herself on every pass, and I'd never have caught it if I didn't read the power trace the way other people read letters.\"", "alt": "Shit, boss, it's talking to itself."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Half of her's up there and half of her's down here, and she never once thought to tell us.\"", "alt": "Half of it up there, half of it down here, and the bastard didn't tell us!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Repairs to what, I'd like to know?\"", "alt": "Repairs to what, for fuck's sake?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I never drew that plate and nobody else did either, because I'd have signed for it. Ask the thing what it thinks it's mending, and see if it'll show you the job.\"", "alt": "I never drew that plate, boss, and nobody else did either, I know every drawing in that shop! So go and ask the bloody thing what it thinks it's mending."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"And the reactor\\'s dead anyway. What are we saving ourselves for?\"", "alt": "And the reactor\\'s dead anyway, so what the fuck are we saving ourselves for?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The old girl's got ${s.machines.reactor.cap < 70 ? 'a few years' : 'maybe a decade'} in her. Then what?\"", "alt": "That reactor's got ${s.machines.reactor.cap < 70 ? 'a few years' : 'maybe a decade'} left in it, boss, and I've checked, and then what?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"It's been humming at me since the day we found it, and it's a hole in every plan I make, and I'm too tired to keep planning round it.\"", "alt": "It's a hole in every plan I make, boss, and I'm sick of planning round the fucking thing!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can run the lamps round the clock and get you another third out of the bay, a bit less once the bulbs start going. The reactor pays for it, though, and a while after that, we do.\"", "alt": "I can run the lamps round the clock, boss, and that's another third, but the reactor pays for every hour of it, and you know who pays the reactor? Me, flat on my back underneath it!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Don't ask me if the doors'll hold, because I went round every bar in the place last night and they held fine.\"", "alt": "Don't ask me if the doors'll hold, boss. I welded them, and I'm not sure."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"It didn't need the door to get in, is what frightens me.\"", "alt": "It didn't need the door to get in, boss, and I don't want to say what that means."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Forty hatches I've welded, and it's had more of us since.\"", "alt": "Forty hatches I've welded, boss, every one of them to gauge, and it's had more of us since."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I'm tired. Tell me what to weld next, because I'm not stopping.\"", "alt": "I'm tired, boss, so tell me what to weld next, because I'm not fucking stopping!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I think she might be singing, and I'd know, because I've heard every other noise she's got.\"", "alt": "Don't laugh, boss, but I think it might be singing."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Might, I said, because the old girl's never done it before in all the years I've had her. I can turn her down an hour and you tell me if it stops, or I turn her off, and everything else goes off with her.\"", "alt": "I signed this thing off myself and it never once did that, boss, not once! I can turn it down an hour and you tell me if it stops, or I turn it off, and everything else goes off with it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Go on, ask what it is, because neither of us knows, and I've never yet run a thing I couldn't open up and look inside of.\"", "alt": "Go on, ask what it is, boss! Neither of us knows, and I don't like running anything I can't open up and look at, for fuck's sake!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's old, the poor thing, built to run a ship and here we've got her running a town, and bits of her are wearing out the way your knees do.\"", "alt": "It's old, boss! It was built to run a ship and we've got it running a whole town, and I've been in there, and bits of it are worn so thin you could read through them."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's walking them in, a bit closer every pass, like somebody finding the range.\"", "alt": "The bastard's walking them in."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"First it was the yard and now this, so I'd say the next one comes down on the machine itself, and I'd put money on it if there was any money here.\"", "alt": "First the yard, now this, so the next one's on the machine itself, and I'd put fucking money on it!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's never run this well, not once since the lander, and I don't know half the people keeping her going.\"", "alt": "It's never run this well, not once since the lander, boss, and I don't know half the goddamn people keeping it going!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I've got three crews out there who can't feel their hands and one that hasn't even noticed the cold, and you can guess which one's ahead of schedule, and I like it about as much as you do.\"", "alt": "Three crews can't feel their hands and one hasn't even noticed the cold, boss! Go on, guess which one's ahead of schedule, and then tell me why I'm not pleased about it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's ship's alloy, and I bolted half of it on myself.\"", "alt": "Shit, boss, that's ship's alloy."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's rated two hundred years in vacuum and she doesn't do that, and in near thirty years of cutting her I've never seen anything do that to her.\"", "alt": "That's rated two hundred years in vacuum, boss. I spent years at the dry dock failing hulls made of it, and I've never once seen anything do that to it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or somebody carried it in on their boots, and either way I want to know what else is hanging on the wrong hook before it gets into the old girl.\"", "alt": "Or somebody carried it, boss! Either way I want to know what else is hanging on the wrong fucking hook!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Give me a lamp and the night and I can tell you which ones are bad today.\"", "alt": "I can tell you which of these bastards are bad today."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"What I can't tell you is which are bad next month, so fit one in a machine and you'll find out with her covers on and her running.\"", "alt": "I can't tell you which are bad next month, boss, and if you fit one you'll find out with the covers on, which is the worst bloody place to find out anything."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She'll hold a while like that, if nobody leans on her.\"", "alt": "It'll hold a while like that, boss, and I hate saying it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Don't ask me how long a while is, because last month I'd have told you twenty years and meant it.\"", "alt": "Don't ask me how long, boss! Last month I'd have told you twenty years, and now I don't know shit!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's one month of coupons, is all that is.\"", "alt": "Shit, that's one bloody month."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The pod'll stand a month like that, a bit more if we keep the door shut.\"", "alt": "The pod'll stand a month like that, boss, I'd sign for a month."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The fan won't, she's clogged solid, and when she goes, whatever's in there goes wherever the air goes.\"", "alt": "The fan won't, boss. When that fan goes, whatever's in there goes wherever the air goes, and the air goes everywhere."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can shut her down tonight if you say so, and she won't thank us for it.\"", "alt": "I can shut the fucking thing down tonight."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Then you tell me what everybody drinks, because I've been stood here working it out and I haven't got an answer.\"", "alt": "Then you tell me what everybody drinks, boss, because I sure as shit can't!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Those are the best welds I've seen since the Huntsville yard, and the one who laid them can't run a straight bead awake to save their life. Go on, you explain that to me, because I can't.\"", "alt": "Best welds I've seen since the dry dock, boss, and I'd pass every one of them! And the one who laid 'em can't run a straight bead awake, so go on, explain that to me."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Eleven blanks. All of 'em true. I haven't cut a true blank awake since the crossing. So no, I'm not that keen to be cured.\"", "alt": "Eleven blanks, boss, and all of 'em true! I haven't cut a true blank awake since the crossing, so no, I'm not that bloody keen to be cured."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's only meant to tick over, and she's been running warm every night since we came down, like a dog that's heard something you haven't. Either something's talking to her or she's talking to something.\"", "alt": "It's only meant to tick over, and it's been warm every night we've been down! Either something's talking to the bastard or it's talking to something, boss."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The lights are on and the air's moving, so somebody's been paying the power bill in there a long while, and I'd like a word with them about where they get their spares.\"", "alt": "Lights on and air moving, boss! Somebody's paying the power bill in there, and I'd like a goddamn word with them!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"We can stop feeding it, easy enough, and then we lose whatever it was built for, and I couldn't tell you which is worse, not on what I know.\"", "alt": "We can stop feeding it, boss, and lose whatever it was for, and I've stood here an hour trying to work out which is worse, and I can't."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I'd give it weeks, not months, and not many weeks at that, so whatever we're doing about it, or not doing, it's now.\"", "alt": "Weeks, boss! Whatever we're doing about it, or not bloody doing, it's now!"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I don't know what kills them here, and I won't unless I look, so give me till tomorrow night and maybe the next little one won't have to die of it. The parents have told me no twice, and if it were mine in that box I'd tell you no as well, so you go and ask them, and you look at their faces while they answer.\"", "alt": "I don't know what kills them here, and I won't unless I look, so give me till tomorrow night and the next child might be spared it. They've refused twice and I'd refuse a third time myself, which is exactly why it ought to be you who goes and asks them again."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's not in any genome I've got on file for them, it's this place doing it to them while they grow, and I won't pretend that doesn't frighten me. The eldest sat on my bench while I read it out and asked me whether it meant something was wrong with them, and I'd like to know what else it's doing before I have to answer that.\"", "alt": "It isn't in any genome I've got on file for them, so it's this place, working on them while they grow. You'll want to know whether it hurts them, and I can't say yet, but the question I'd rather you asked is what else it's doing, and to whom."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Four thousand people nobody here is kin to.\"", "alt": "Four thousand people nobody here is kin to, kept cold on power my medicines could use, and they're the only patients I've ever had who don't complain about the wait."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Don't look at me like that, I told you what it is and I never once said use it. If you order it, you come and stand at the cot and hold the hand of whichever child gets it first, because I won't have them looking up at nobody but me.\"", "alt": "You're looking at me as though I'd offered it, when all I've done is tell you what it is. If you order it, you'll stand at the cot while it's given, since it seems only fair that whoever decides should watch."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"There's no fever and nothing hurts, and the youngest of the three keeps asking me if that means it's good news.\"", "alt": "They've no fever and no pain, which is the part you'll repeat to people, and it tells me nothing about whether they'll get better."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I don't know how it spreads and I don't know if it stops, and I haven't told them it's nothing, so you don't get to either.\"", "alt": "I don't know how it spreads, or whether it stops, and those are the only two questions I'd ask of it. Until I can answer either, nobody tells those three it's nothing."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not ill, I checked every one of them, and they've looked at this place and at their own plates and decided. One of them sat in my clinic with both hands round a cup and said 'Into this?' to me, and the rest said it near enough word for word.\"", "alt": "I've examined them and there's nothing wrong with any of them, which is rather the trouble, because it's a decision and not a symptom. Every one of them gives me the same answer, 'Into this?', and I have nothing to treat it with."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'll run it if you order it, and I'll be the one standing at the clinic wall when they come to read whose name's been ruled against theirs.\"", "alt": "You may order it and I'll run it, and the book will say who gave the order."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Just don't ask me to call it medicine, because I'll be lying to every one of them if I do.\"", "alt": "It's a stud book with the clinic's name on the cover, and I'd rather the name came off."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"And then there's a baby in a glass box that's nobody's, crying at three in the morning for somebody who isn't coming, so you tell me who gets up for it, because it won't be you.\"", "alt": "And when there's a baby out of every one of them and it's nobody's, who gets up in the night? I ask because the answer is always the clinic, and the clinic is me."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've got a ward full of children who've never once been somebody's, and the smallest of them calls me by the word for whoever's on shift. Fix that, or come and tell them to their faces that you won't.\"", "alt": "I have a ward full of children in there who've never once been anybody's, and I'd like you either to fix it or to say out loud that you won't, since I can't treat it from the ward."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"The loom doesn't take anything out of them, it just grabs the controls, and they've been in there the whole time, awake, watching their own hands. That one in the yard was saying a name because it's the only thing left they can say with their own mouth, so you look me in the eye and tell me there's nobody home.\"", "alt": "The loom doesn't remove anyone, it takes the controls, which means they've been in there the whole time, awake, watching their own hands work. You were about to ask whether they can be got back, and the question underneath it is what they've been made to watch, so hear that first."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"At this rate there's nobody left here in forty years, whatever else we get right, and I hate that it's me who has to stand here and say it. I know every mother in my book by name, and there just aren't enough of them.\"", "alt": "At this rate there's nobody here in forty years, and nothing else we get right will alter it. Somebody had to say so, and I've never been any good at softening a prognosis."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They'll live, and they'll need somebody every day of their lives, and they'll never work, and it's about one birth in four until I find out why. The newest one got hold of my finger this morning and wouldn't let go. The midwives want to know what we do with them, and they want to hear it from you, not from me.\"", "alt": "They'll live, though they'll need someone every day of their lives and they'll never work, and it's about one birth in four until I work out why. The midwives want to know what we do with them, and they want it said by you and not by me, so you can stop looking for a gentler way to ask."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can wake those twelve now into a colony that can't feed them, or move them to the good banks if the lander can make the trip, and I'd be guessing either way. Or we wait, and you come and stand next to me and watch their pods go red one at a time, because I'm not watching that on my own.\"", "alt": "I can wake them now into a colony that can't feed them, or move them to the good banks if the lander can make the trip. Or we wait and you watch the board go red beside me, which is what doing nothing looks like once somebody's honest about it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Or we wait till the ground's proven, because they'll keep, and frozen they don't eat. The children want goats, I know, I've heard about nothing else in my clinic, but I'd sooner they had full bowls first, if you're asking me.\"", "alt": "Or we wait until the ground's proven, since frozen embryos keep and eat nothing. You're really asking whether the people or the livestock come first, and I'd feed the people."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Then it stays packed, and we set it up on the worst day of the year, in the rain, with somebody bleeding on me and asking me where the beds are. I'd rather be able to tell them the beds are made.\"", "alt": "Then it stays in its crates, and we unpack it on the worst day of the year, in the rain, with somebody bleeding on the lid while I read the instructions by torchlight."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"We don't know a thing about out there, and not much more about what it's already done to us, and I've had people in my clinic asking what they breathed coming down that ramp. Let me look at them before you ask them to go and look at it.\"", "alt": "We know nothing about out there and not a great deal more about what it's already done to us, so I'd like to examine them before anyone asks them to examine it. You're really asking where to point the machine first, and the answer is at the patients."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not angry yet, they're frightened, and the ones who lost somebody keep asking me whose word it was. Somebody's got to tell them, and it had better be you, standing up in that hall, not me passing it on at a bedside.\"", "alt": "Nobody's angry yet, which is only the incubation period. Someone has to tell them the truth of it, and it had better be you."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Nobody's come in to complain all month. Nobody. You want something to worry about, worry about that.\"", "alt": "Nobody has come in to complain all month, and I've been at this long enough to know a quiet clinic is not a healthy one. If you want something to worry about, start there."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't name it.\"", "alt": "I can't put a name to it, and the name isn't what you want anyway, you want to know whether you've got it, so hold out your arm."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've got two drugs that might touch it and a store packed for the ground. You woke me to treat them, so let me treat them.\"", "alt": "I have two drugs that might touch it and a store that was packed for the ground, not for this. You woke me to treat them, so I'd be obliged if you'd let me."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"There are a hundred people asleep in here. Whatever you decide, decide it for them.\"", "alt": "There are a hundred people asleep in here, and not one of them has a say. Decide it for them, and do the arithmetic honestly."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'm a doctor. I'd know.\"", "alt": "I'm the doctor, so if anything were wrong I'd have found it before you thought to ask."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can thaw them properly up here, in the infirmary. Some of them. Give me the word.\"", "alt": "I can thaw them properly up here in the infirmary, some of them, and I won't pretend that means all of them. Give me the word."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Get them down here. Now. Or I'm talking someone through it by radio, and I won't promise anything.\"", "alt": "Get them down here at once, or I'll talk somebody through it by radio, and I'll promise you nothing about how that ends."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Of course they went for the pen, there's nobody in there anyone counts or misses.\"", "alt": "You're wondering why the pen and not the rows, and it's the same answer I'd give about any sickness, it goes where nobody's looking."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Those two had names, and you built them a larder and put a fence round it.\"", "alt": "Nobody counts them and nobody misses them, so you built the eaters a larder and put a fence round it, and I'd call that a design error."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Don't ask me which, because I can't tell you, and the mothers have already asked me.\"", "alt": "I couldn't tell you which, and the hall isn't really asking which, it's asking who to blame."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've got ${TH.num(c.n)} patients nobody'll sit next to and now half the hall wants a cup of their blood. Tell me what you want done before somebody goes and takes it.\"", "alt": "I have ${TH.num(c.n)} patients nobody will sit beside, and half the hall now wants a cup of their blood. Say what you want done, because somebody will help themselves before long."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's staph, ours, and they've got no defence against it at all, and they've carried their sick to us anyway, knowing full well where it came from. Get me gloves, and somebody bring water for the small one at the back.\"", "alt": "That's staph, and it's ours, and they have no defence against it whatsoever. They've brought us their sick knowing exactly where it came from, which is more courage than we've shown them, so I'll need gloves."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They did the nursing themselves, and I only told them what not to do, and one of their old ones held my hand the whole of the last night as if I were family.\"", "alt": "They did the nursing, and I mostly stood about telling them what not to touch."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Most of them lived, and I keep counting the ones who didn't.\"", "alt": "Most of them lived, and I'd rather not be asked to define most."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Or I'm wrong about both, and I don't know what this is, and I've got people sitting in my clinic asking me why they can't dream and nothing to tell them.\"", "alt": "Or I've misdiagnosed both, and I've no idea what this is."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Which is it? Patients, I can treat. If it's a fire, you say so, out loud, and you put it out yourself.\"", "alt": "Which are you asking for, a treatment or a fire? Patients I can treat, and if it's a fire you'll say so out loud and see to it yourself."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Six of them, one row. If I'm right — and I'd love not to be — next we'll see ${x.K.sign}.\"", "alt": "Six of them, all from one row, and if I'm right, which I usually am and would be glad not to be this time, next we'll see ${x.K.sign}."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Twenty names, four beds. So you tell me how I'm meant to choose, because I'm not doing it on my own.\"", "alt": "I have twenty names and four beds. I can rank them by who's likeliest to live, but the rest of the ranking is yours, and I won't make it alone."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"We know next to nothing about it, and they've got less. No surgeon, no notes. They're just burying their dead, and I don't know how to stand here and let them.\"", "alt": "We know very little about it and they know less, with no surgeon and no notes, and they're burying their dead. You're asking whether it's our business, and a sickness next door is always our business, since it has never once stopped at a line on the ground."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"The good and the harm in it are two different things, and I can't get the harm out of the plant, but I think I can change us so we keep the good and leave the rest. Before you say yes, you hear what it costs the people I'd be doing it to, because they'll be on my table and not on yours.\"", "alt": "The good in it and the harm in it are separate things, and I can't take the harm out of the plant, so I'd take it out of us and keep the good. Before you agree, you ought to hear what it costs the people it's done to, because I'll be the one doing it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Gloves on anyone who touches it, and nobody touches it who doesn't have to, and the six who brought it home come straight to me before they've hugged anybody.\"", "alt": "Gloves on anyone who touches it, and nobody touches it who needn't."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I mean it, and that goes for you too.\"", "alt": "That includes you, and I'm saying so plainly because people tend to hear 'anyone' as 'anyone else'."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That isn't a test, it's a party trick, and whoever it reads wrong has to walk home past everyone they know, so give me the bench.\"", "alt": "That isn't a test, it's a performance, and what the hall really wants out of it is somebody to point at. Somebody gets hurt for it either way, so give me the bench."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Mine failed, and I ran it twice, so you can stop staring at the plate.\"", "alt": "Mine failed, and I ran it twice before I believed it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Put me on your list, then, but you're not taking the needle off me until somebody else here can find a vein.\"", "alt": "So put me on your list with everyone else, and then notice that nobody else here can find a vein."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't get it out of a living child without cutting what it's wound round, and I could learn how, but I'd be learning on one of them. Whichever child I open first gets a coin toss, maybe, and I'll have looked the parents in the eye before I pick up the knife.\"", "alt": "I can't remove it from a living child without cutting what it's wound round. I could learn how, but only by practising on one of them, and the first child I open gets perhaps the odds of a coin."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Give them a date, or give them something to do with their hands, I don't care which, because they're lying in my ward staring at the wall. One of them asked me this morning what the sun felt like, as if they'd forgotten, and I had nothing to tell them.\"", "alt": "Give them a date, or give them something to do instead, and I'll accept either. They're lying in the ward staring at the wall, and I have nothing that treats that."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's in the brain, and they know something's wrong even while they're laughing, you can see it in their eyes.\"", "alt": "It's in the brain, so I'll know exactly where once one of them is past minding me looking."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's something they ate, and I can't do anything but sit with them while they go, so don't ask me for more than that.\"", "alt": "It's something they ate, and nothing on my shelf reverses it, so all I can do is sit with them. You're asking me how to save them, and what you ought to be asking is who else ate it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's a person on that chain, and they're watching the door because they think whoever comes through it is going to hurt them.\"", "alt": "I'll spare you the consultation, that's a person."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Look at the hands before anyone starts, because that's somebody's grandchild, off a ship like ours.\"", "alt": "Before anyone starts composing an opinion, look at the hands. That's somebody's grandchild, off a ship much like ours."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"There's nothing wrong with ${c.oldF} that I know of, and it's been eating at that poor soul all day that I can't say more.\"", "alt": "I've found nothing wrong with ${c.oldF}, and I looked like a man who expected to."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's what frightens me, so let me look, and keep the child away from the ward while I do.\"", "alt": "A clean result is exactly what worries me, because healthy people don't usually get told a date. Let me look properly, and keep the child out of the ward until I have."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"So before you say whatever you're about to say, you remember that, and if you want ${c.ear} for something you come through me first.\"", "alt": "Keep that in mind before you say anything else. If you want ${c.ear} for something, you'll ask me first, and I'll tell you what the child can bear."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"No, you don't get to look, and neither does anybody else, because I want one person left who remembers that face the way it was.\"", "alt": "No, you won't be looking at it, and that isn't a courtesy."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Sit down first, and I'll tell you what's gone.\"", "alt": "I'll tell you what's gone once you've sat down, since people take that news better when they've somewhere to fall."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You keep sending me what's left of them.\"", "alt": "You keep sending me what's left of them, and that's a very poor way to study anything."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'm going to look at it once, before it sends me another. Open the gate.\"", "alt": "I'd like to see it once before it sends me another. Open the gate."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Look at ${c.ptf}, sitting there with both nostrils packed and apologising to me for the blood on my floor.\"", "alt": "Have a look at ${c.ptf}, and never mind the nose."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's what no sleep does to the eyes, and it's doing it to half the rows, so talk about the floor all you like, but you come down and look first.\"", "alt": "Those eyes are what no sleep looks like, and half the rows have them. Argue about the floor as long as you like, but come down and look at this first."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Three in a month, in a colony this size, so don't tell me it's the floor and don't tell me it isn't, just tell me what you're doing for the ones still carrying.\"", "alt": "Three in a month, in a colony this size, and I won't say whether it's the floor, because I don't know and neither do you. What you can tell me is what you're doing for the ones still carrying."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can put them under, and they'd thank me for it tonight, because they'll take anything that makes it stop.\"", "alt": "You're asking whether I can put them under, and I can."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I don't want to, because you don't know what a season under does to a person, so if you want it, you ask me out loud and then I'll do it.\"", "alt": "I'd rather not, since a season under does things to a person that I'd be charting for the rest of their life. Ask me and I'll do it, but it will be you who asked."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"There's nothing wrong with this baby, it's feeding and it's warm, and the only one in this room who's crying is the parent.\"", "alt": "I've examined this baby, and it's the healthiest patient I've had all month."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"So it's the parent I'm looking at, and I'd like a day with the two of them, quietly, before anybody decides anything.\"", "alt": "So the symptom is somewhere else, and I'd like a day with both of them."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've been through it twice, and I delivered half of these myself, so I know whose initials are on which line.\"", "alt": "I've been through it twice, line by line."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Every line's right, but that isn't the same as every child, and I won't tell a mother at my door that it is.\"", "alt": "Every line is correct, which tells you the clerk was careful and nothing at all about the children."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It'll give you an answer, and every one of those families will hold that card as if it had their child's name on it.\"", "alt": "It will certainly give you an answer."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't promise you it's the truth, and those aren't the same thing, so you'd better hear it from me now, before you're the one telling a parent that the child in their arms isn't theirs.\"", "alt": "What I can't promise is that the answer's true, and you're about to confuse the two, so I'd rather you heard it now than after the first household has read the result."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Somebody's got to want them, that's all I need, one person who'll pick them up when they cry.\"", "alt": "Somebody has to want them, and I can't prescribe that. One person would be enough."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's ${c.bn} people warming up in the dark, who went to sleep trusting somebody would wake them properly.\"", "alt": "You're looking at ${c.bn} people warming up in the dark."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Get them down or get the power on, I don't care which, but you do it now.\"", "alt": "Either get them down or get the power back on, and I'm indifferent as to which, but it will be done now."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Not one of them's got so much as a cough, and every one of them's turned down the survey rota, and when I ask them why they just look at me, kindly, as if I'm the one who's ill. So don't ask me to call it good news.\"", "alt": "Not one of them has so much as coughed, and each has turned down the survey rota without being able to say why, so don't mistake it for good news."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's every one of them without so much as a cold, and on six hours' sleep they do the work of people on eight, and not one has come to me with a single worry in their head. I want to know why before anybody calls it good.\"", "alt": "Thirty of them, and none has had so much as a cold. They sleep six hours and do the work of people who sleep eight, and I'd like to know why before anyone calls that health."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can tell you who, but you think first, about what a list of names does to a place this small, and what it does to whoever's name is at the top, and then you ask me.\"", "alt": "I can tell you who, and you may want to consider first what a list of names does to a place this small. Then you'll know what you're actually asking me for."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It kills one in five, maybe, and not one of them has asked me to cure them, not one. They'd have to want to be what they were before, and they don't, and I'd be doing it to them anyway.\"", "alt": "About one in five, perhaps, and not one of them has asked to be cured, which I'd call the more interesting symptom."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Of course it's doubled, because you shut people in together and it does in weeks what used to take a season. Every one of them who comes through my door asks me for a bed by a window, and I haven't got one to give.\"", "alt": "Shut people in together and it does in a few weeks what used to take a season, and I'd have said so if anyone had asked me how it spreads instead of whether."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Mf}'s fine, sitting on my bench asking me what to call it, and that's the part I can't get past.\"", "alt": "${c.Mf} is perfectly well, and that's the part I can't get past."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Come down and read the tape yourself, and then you tell me what I say to them.\"", "alt": "Come down and read the tape yourself, and then tell me what I'm to say to them, since I've run out of diagnoses that fit."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not right, and they ask me every time I send for them why I look so worried.\"", "alt": "I'll say only that they aren't right."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Don't ask me what I mean by it, because I've had those pictures up all night and I can't tell you yet.\"", "alt": "I couldn't tell you what I mean by it, and I've had them under observation all night. You're asking for a conclusion, and I haven't got one yet."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't examine a patient who's stronger than my orderlies and won't sit down, and they've stopped coming because every time they do I look frightened, and they've noticed.\"", "alt": "I can't examine a patient who's stronger than my orderlies and has no intention of sitting down."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"And don't you dare send the watch for them.\"", "alt": "And sending the watch would turn a clinical problem into a siege, so I'd ask you not to."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're my patients, and the families aren't, and neither are you, so that paper counts for about as much as one I'd write.\"", "alt": "They're my patients, which the families are not, and neither are you."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Mf} says no, and I've got no test that says ${c.mf} doesn't mean it.\"", "alt": "${c.Mf} says no, and I haven't a test in the clinic that proves ${c.mf} doesn't mean it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I wrote it down because it's true, and I never said I'd do it.\"", "alt": "I wrote it down because it's accurate, and accuracy isn't a promise to act."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You'll have to order me, and you'll say the name of the one you've chosen out loud when you do.\"", "alt": "You'll have to order me, and when you do, you'll say her name out loud, because I'll be writing it in the book."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Mf}'s my patient and that's a birth, and the first thing that child hears isn't going to be a rifle.\"", "alt": "${c.Mf} is my patient, and what's coming is a birth."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Anybody who walks into my clinic with a rifle had better be in labour, and you can tell the watch I said so.\"", "alt": "Anyone who walks into the clinic carrying a rifle had better be in labour, because that's the only presentation I'll accept."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Whatever you're about to say, you say it to them yourself, to their faces.\"", "alt": "Whatever you're about to ask me to say, you'll say it to them yourself."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Through the window, if that's what it takes, because I'm not carrying it over for you.\"", "alt": "Through the window, and I won't be carrying it across for you."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Or we do nothing, and let them sleep in their own beds with somebody sitting up beside them.\"", "alt": "Or you could do nothing, which has the merit of being a treatment."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Half of what I saw last time was people who hadn't slept for seven nights, and if you shut them in they won't sleep for seven more.\"", "alt": "Half of what I saw was people who hadn't slept for seven nights, and shutting them in will give them seven more, which is how you turn a symptom into the disease."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not dangerous, they stand at that window because they want to, and they're frightened of the rows, not the other way round.\"", "alt": "On the evidence, they aren't dangerous."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're no danger to you, and I won't hear anyone call them that in my ward.\"", "alt": "Not to you, and I'd ask that nobody say otherwise where I can hear it, since that's how a symptom gets a reputation."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's in bone, and nobody's cutting into a good leg because a door latch fell off, so you tell them that, or I will.\"", "alt": "It's in bone, and nobody is cutting into a sound leg because a door latch fell off. Tell them so, or I will, and I'll be much more exact than you."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Tf} was washing glass, that's all, and came straight to me the minute it itched, which is exactly what I tell people to do.\"", "alt": "${c.Tf} was washing glass, and that is the entire offence."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Before anyone decides anything about ${c.tf}, you come down to the clinic and you look at the arm.\"", "alt": "Before anyone decides anything about ${c.tf}, you'll come down to the clinic and look at the arm, because I'd like the decision made by someone who's seen the evidence."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I need to know what they died of, and I know the families want them in the ground tonight, and in their place I'd want the same.\"", "alt": "I need to know what killed them, because the dead are the only patients who can tell me how it spreads."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"So do you, and so does whoever's next in that row, so you go and tell the families that.\"", "alt": "So do you, and so does whoever's next in that row, and you may as well be the one to tell the families."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's a person in there, and they went in because somebody had to.\"", "alt": "There is a person in there."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You remember that, and either cut the door or tell me to my face why not.\"", "alt": "Hold onto that, and then either cut the door or give me your reasons for leaving it, face to face."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I closed that leg in my sleep, and it's the neatest work I've done here. So you tell me which of me you want on the ward. Go on.\"", "alt": "I closed that leg asleep, and it's the neatest work I've done here, which I find both interesting and insulting. So you can tell me which of me you'd like on the ward, and be honest about why."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Look at the shelf, that's all that's left, and when it's gone they all go down at once, every one of them, for as long as their bodies need. The hauler who talked a whole shift through with a dead shipmate will be the first one down, and whatever this is gets the lot of them in one night.\"", "alt": "Have a look at the shelf, since that's what's left, and when it's gone they all go down at once, for as long as they need, and whatever this is takes the lot of them in one night."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Come and look at the welts on them, go on, and then you tell me how many more nights you want.\"", "alt": "Come down and look at them, and then tell me how many more nights you're proposing, since I'd like the number said aloud."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Come and look at their hands, go on, I've splinted every finger in that row, and then you tell me how many more nights you want.\"", "alt": "Have a look at their hands, and then tell me how many more nights this is worth."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I doubt it means anything by it, that's just what it's like when something that size looks at you. My patients are paying for it all the same, and not one of them asked to be looked at.\"", "alt": "I doubt it means anything by it. What I've got is a ward of people whose hearts won't slow down, which is what it does to you when something that size looks at you, and the hearts I can treat."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"If ${dn(s)} is talking to anyone it's ${c.first}, being used or being asked, I can't tell you which, and the poor soul didn't want it mentioned at all. Nobody's opening ${c.first} up to find out, not while I'm here.\"", "alt": "If ${dn(s)} is talking to anyone, it's ${c.first}, but I can't tell whether that's being used or being asked. Nobody is opening ${c.first} up to find out, and I'd call that a medical opinion as well as a moral one."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's the seed bench or nothing, I know that, I know there's wheat a hand's width away, but you haven't even held the jar up to the light yet, and once you have you'll stop asking me where.\"", "alt": "I can do the culture on the seed bench, Administrator, or I can't do it at all, and I'd ask you to examine the sample before you decide, since any decision made without it is made on less than I have."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It could feed the north field, or it could get loose and feed everything else, probably both, and the only way to find out which is to grow it on, which is the one thing you'd least like me to do, I know, I've been sleeping next to it, I know.\"", "alt": "It could feed the north field, or it could escape and feed everything else, and I'd put the chance of both at better than even. The only way to price it is to grow it on, and I would like that done before the cost becomes a matter of opinion."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Somebody's got to eat it, every day for a month, and I'd start tonight, I'd keep the log myself, weight and sleep and what comes out the other end, all of it, if you'd only let me, which you won't, I can see your face.\"", "alt": "Someone will have to eat it every day for a month, and I would begin tonight myself, Administrator, if you'd sanction it. I can see from your expression that you won't, which I'll record as a cost of a month's delay."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The chemistry's perfect, it's almost insulting how perfect, and they're the only big animal on this world we could actually live on, and yes, I know what else they are, I ran it twice hoping I'd botched it and I hadn't. You'll have to decide this one, because I can't, and I keep catching myself wanting to say yes.\"", "alt": "The chemistry is clean, and they're the only large animal on this world we could live on, which I'd value above anything else we've found. I'm aware of what else they are, which is why I ran the analysis twice, and I would ask you to take the decision, Administrator, since my own recommendation would be yes and I don't regard myself as impartial."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"In a person? Nobody knows, that's the whole point, the first few will probably die of it and I'll learn why from them, and then it'll work, and then we can eat the ground we're standing on, think about that. I need people to find out on, and I can hear exactly how that sounds.\"", "alt": "In a person, I can't yet say. I would expect the first few cases to be lost and the cause established from them, after which the method works and the colony can eat the ground it stands on. I'll require subjects, Administrator, and I would rather not spend your time on how that sounds."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It'll grow on any metal that stays warm, and under a fingernail too, two of the scraping crew have got it and it won't come off, and, sorry, yes, that's bad, but don't let them scrub it yet, it's crawling to the warm end of the slide, it's going toward the heat!\"", "alt": "It will grow on any metal that stays warm, and on skin. Two of the scraping crew are already colonised and it does not wash off, so I would ask that nobody scrub them until I've taken what I can from the living tissue."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Spares run out, everything runs out, but give me a rig and some ore and we make our own, and the cores we'd pull up with it, the whole history of this ground in a tube, layer by layer, sorry, the rig, I'm asking you for the rig!\"", "alt": "Spares run out, as everything does, whereas a rig and some ore would let us make our own, and the ground under it may hold a good deal more than ore. I'm asking for the rig, Administrator, because a spare is spent once and a rig goes on paying for itself."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I can test it tonight, I can test it right now, only don't ask me how, because you'll say no, and I'd really rather not be told no about this one.\"", "alt": "I can test it tonight, Administrator, provided you don't ask me how, since I've found that a description invites a refusal and a refusal would cost us the result."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It could feed the wheat, or it could eat the wheat, I don't know which yet, and I have to know which, give me one plot and I'll find out, no wait, give me a fence and one plot.\"", "alt": "It could feed the wheat or it could consume it, and I require one plot, fenced, to establish which. I'd be obliged if the fence went up before the sowing, since the answer is worth more to me than the wheat."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Or it's trying to, and it can't be, their pollen and ours shouldn't even recognise each other, so either my eyes are wrong or this is the best thing that's happened since landfall, and can we keep some, please, before somebody burns the row?\"", "alt": "Or it is attempting to, which ought not to be possible, so either my reading is wrong or this is the most useful thing that has happened here. I'd like a sample kept under seal, and I'd put the risk of keeping it well below the cost of never learning which."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The drag figures are, no, sorry, they\\'re fascinating, actually, but we need to burn, we do need to burn, I\\'m just going to look at them for one more minute first.\"", "alt": "The drag figures are of considerable value, Administrator, and I'd like one further minute with them, which I'd judge the cheapest minute of the whole approach. I do accept that the burn is required, and I shan't hold it a moment past that."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I'm asking them about Earth.\"", "alt": "I'm taking a record of what they remember of Earth, one subject at a time."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The things nobody wrote down, what the rain smelled like, what a Tuesday was, somebody has to, and nobody else is, hold on, you're not putting that in the log, are you?\"", "alt": "The things nobody recorded, such as what the rain smelled like and what a Tuesday consisted of, will be lost with the last of them, and the record will be the poorer. I would ask that this stay out of the log, Administrator, since I'd rather not have the method reviewed."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It changed rhythm when we opened the pipe, and then again when I talked to it, and yes, I talked to it, out loud, like an idiot, and it answered, so that's no plant, that's, no wait, I don't know what that is, and I want to.\"", "alt": "It changed rhythm when we opened the pipe and again when I addressed it aloud, which I did, and it answered. That makes it no plant I can classify, and I intend to establish what it is, provided that the cable is left intact long enough."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It still goes round the patch we burned, every time, so it remembers, and I don\\'t think I like what it remembers us as.\"", "alt": "It still routes round the patch we burned, which I'd take as evidence of memory, and a thing that remembers can be taught what to avoid."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's worked out which plants are ours.\"", "alt": "It has learned, Administrator, to distinguish our plants from the native ones."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Only ours, every native root left alone, so we're the pest, we're the weed, and that's, I'm sorry, I know what it's cost us, but that's incredible.\"", "alt": "Only ours, with every native root left alone, so we are the pest. The discrimination is remarkable, and it's also the first useful thing it has shown us, since a system that can tell us apart can be bargained with or can be targeted."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's four degrees warmer than the air, and the ${LF.lex(s, 'top')} sitting on it is two million years old, two million, so what's keeping it warm, and for how long, and, hold on, is it keeping itself warm?\"", "alt": "It's four degrees warmer than the air, and the ${LF.lex(s, 'top')} on it is two million years old, so something has kept it warm for all that time. I'd like to know what, Administrator, and whether it maintains itself, since a source of heat that lasts two million years would be worth more than anything we brought down."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"They're talking to each other.\"", "alt": "They are communicating with one another."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"About us, I'd bet my bench on it, and if you stand still and stop breathing so loud you can hear the east one wait for the north one to finish.\"", "alt": "About us, I'd estimate with some confidence. Listen to it before you decide anything, Administrator, because the pattern holds more information than any summary of mine could."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Every year there's a season where nothing grows, nothing, the orbit's eccentric, and you'd never have seen it from the ship, you need the mud, you have to put your hands in the actual mud, which, I mean, I did, obviously.\"", "alt": "Every year there is a season in which nothing grows, owing to the eccentricity of the orbit, and it cannot be seen from the ship. It requires the sediment, which I have handled personally, as one must."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The Dim's ${90 - s.day > 15 ? 'about ' + Math.round((90 - s.day) / 10) + ' months' : 'a month or less'} away, and it's going to be cold, really cold, colder than the drills ever got, and I've already got a thermometer down in the mud because I want to see how far down the cold goes.\"", "alt": "The Dim is ${90 - s.day > 15 ? 'about ' + Math.round((90 - s.day) / 10) + ' months' : 'a month or less'} away, Administrator, and it will be severe. I would note that I'm less disturbed by this than the figures warrant, and I'd suggest that you be more so on the colony's behalf."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Once or twice a century you get a double dark layer, and I took it for a bad core, I was so pleased with myself for catching the error, and it wasn't an error, was it?\"", "alt": "Once or twice a century there is a double dark layer, and I classified it as a defective core and was satisfied with the correction. It was not a defect, and the error is mine, which I'd rather enter in the record now than have someone else find it there."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Ask, pay, or just take it, and they're up on the ridge right now watching to see which one we are, and isn't that something, that someone's watching to find out what we are?\"", "alt": "We may ask, pay, or take, and they are on the ridge now observing which of the three we are. I would note that this is itself a result, Administrator, since it tells us what they have been taught to expect."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Something in there keeps ${x.othem} out, something ${x.othey} won't go near, and I want it, whatever it is, I want to know what it is more than I've wanted anything.\"", "alt": "Something in there keeps ${x.othem} out, something ${x.othey} will not approach, and I intend to identify it. I would rank it above every other open question we have, and I'm prepared to pay accordingly."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${UK[PT(s, 'understory').truth.keeps]}.\"", "alt": "${UK[PT(s, 'understory').truth.keeps]}."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${HW[PT(s, 'hive').truth.why]}.\"", "alt": "${HW[PT(s, 'hive').truth.why]}."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's following us, down the path and round the water tanks, and it's done this before with something else, you can tell by how it never steps where we'd look, and I'm sorry, I know what it's for, but it's so good at it.\"", "alt": "It is following us, down the path and round the water tanks, and it has done this before with something else, because nothing is that efficient on a first attempt. I'd like to know how it hunts, Administrator, since we shall either have to defend against the method or borrow it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It doesn't even know we exist, that's the thing, it's built for the grazers and we just wandered in and helped ourselves, like a fly in a flower that was never meant for flies, and it's the most elegant accident I've ever seen.\"", "alt": "It doesn't know we exist. It's built for the grazers, and we found it and helped ourselves, which I'd call the most economical accident I've encountered, and one we may be able to use."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Don't burn it.\"", "alt": "Nobody burns it, Administrator, until I've had it on the table."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Please, whatever killed it, it's the first whole one we've had, and if there's anything in it at all, any, hold on, just give me the table before anyone lights anything.\"", "alt": "Whatever killed it, this is the first whole specimen we have had, and anything of value in it I shan't recover from ash."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Let me in there.\"", "alt": "I'll go in myself."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Just me, with a lamp, nobody else, because whatever it's doing it's doing it now, and if we wait till morning we'll only be looking at what it's finished doing.\"", "alt": "Alone, with a lamp, Administrator. Whatever it is doing, it is doing now, and an observation is worth a great deal more to me than the cold-room hand's account of one."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Which is interesting, isn't it, because I feel exactly the same as I did this morning, so either the test's wrong or I'm the kind of thing that wouldn't know, and I can't think of an experiment that tells those two apart from the inside.\"", "alt": "I feel entirely as I did before, which means that either the test is in error or I would not be able to tell, and I would point out that the second is not excluded."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's still in them, whatever it was, and put it in a dish and it'll do what it was going to do, and then we'd actually know, wouldn't we? Don't you want to know?\"", "alt": "It is still in them, whatever it was, and a culture would show what it intended to do. I would have thought that worth a grave, Administrator, and I'd have thought the parents' feelings a smaller cost than not knowing."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Four years of food, sealed up and buried, and who does that, you only do that if it's happened to you before, so either they remember something or somebody told them, and I'd give a great deal to know which.\"", "alt": "Four years of food, sealed and buried, which one does only after a previous failure, so either they remember something or they were told it. I would pay a considerable amount to establish which."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It all runs dark, every bit of it, whoever built this knew the sun goes away and planned round it like weather, the way we planned for the polar night on the drills, and we only knew because somebody told us, so who told them?\"", "alt": "All of it is designed to run dark, and whoever built it understood that the sun goes away and planned for it as for weather. I'd like to meet them, Administrator, and ask how they knew and what it cost them."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"See that band, nothing living in it, and here, and here, everything just stops and then it starts again, every time, and if I can get the spacing right I can tell you when the next one is, which is the part I'm trying very hard not to be excited about.\"", "alt": "See that band, with nothing living in it, and here, and here. Everything stops and resumes at intervals, and if I can establish the spacing I can tell you when the next one falls, which is the one finding here that would let us plan the stores around it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"They've lost whatever told them when to stop.\"", "alt": "They have lost whatever told them when to stop."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"And they don't know any more, which is, isn't that, sorry, no, yes, it's bad, I know it's bad, and it's also the most interesting thing I've seen since landfall.\"", "alt": "And they no longer have any means of knowing, which is a serious matter for the colony and, in the same measure, the most informative thing to happen since landfall."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's the same animal, the same animal, look at the jaw, there's one season between those two, and that ought to take, no, never mind what it ought to take, just look at the jaw!\"", "alt": "It is the same animal, and the jaw is the evidence. That is one season, which is faster than any model I know permits, and you should look at the jaw before you ask me to explain it, because the explanation is the less reliable of the two."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's too fast, much too fast, and every change runs the same way, toward us, and nothing evolves like that, that isn't evolving, that's answering, so what's it answering, what does it think we did?\"", "alt": "It is much too fast, and all of it runs in one direction, toward us. I would like to know what it is answering, Administrator, and what it believes we did."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"There, right there, either that's where it's coming from or it's where everything goes anyway, and I can't tell which from a map, so somebody has to go and look, and I'll go, I've been packed since the lines crossed!\"", "alt": "The lines cross there, so either that is the source or it is where everything passes regardless, and a map cannot separate the two. Someone must go and look, and I'm prepared to be that person, provided that you authorise it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Four, and we drilled sixty metres off and got dust, so how does a kid know, no, never mind how, I'll get to how, I want to walk that ground tonight, with a lamp, before anyone else does.\"", "alt": "And we drilled sixty metres off it and found dust, so I want to know how a child came by the figure. I intend to walk that ground tonight."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It has to lie up somewhere, doesn't it? Everything does, half a day out, less, and nobody's even looked.\"", "alt": "It must lie up somewhere, as every animal does, within half a day of here, and nobody has examined the place. I'd regard a party sent to find it as the cheapest knowledge still on offer to us."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I only want to see the place, just the place, I wouldn't touch a, no wait, lift the bar, will you?\"", "alt": "I want only to see the place, Administrator, and I shan't touch anything in it, so I'd be obliged if you'd lift the bar."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"You can't hear it.\"", "alt": "You cannot hear it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"That's the lovely part, it's under hearing, something down there's ringing and we're all sitting on the bell, and I don't even care what it is yet, I just want one geophone on the mess floor, one, is that so much to ask?\"", "alt": "Which means it sits below hearing, and something beneath us is ringing while we sleep on top of it. I require one geophone on the mess floor, and I would regard refusing it as an expensive economy."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Why some nights?\"", "alt": "Why only on certain nights?"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's there and then it isn't, which means something's switching it, which is the best news we've had, so give me sensors in a line across the site and one quiet night, just one, and I'll tell you where it lives.\"", "alt": "It is present and then absent, which implies that something is switching it, and that is the most useful finding we have had. I'll require sensors in a line across the site and one quiet night, and I will tell you where it lives."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Thirty metres and a charge.\"", "alt": "Thirty metres, with a charge at the bottom."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"And then we'd know, wouldn't you want to know, it's right under us, it's been under us the whole time, and we're all lying on top of it asking what it is when we could just go down and ask it.\"", "alt": "And then we would know, Administrator. It is directly beneath us and has been throughout, and we lie on top of it asking what it is when we could descend and put the question to it, at a price I'd call reasonable."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It'll walk, it'll talk, it'll learn its letters, it'll ask why the sky's that colour, and put twenty of them in the school and the place has children in it, and people who see children, well, they stand a bit taller, don't they, I keep watching the schoolroom door and I think they would.\"", "alt": "It will walk, speak and learn its letters, and it will ask why the sky is that colour, and twenty of them in the school would give the colony children. People who see children stand a little taller, and having watched the schoolroom door for some while, I'd expect the effect on morale to be large enough to measure, which is more than one can say for most of what we spend materials on."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"That one\\'s for the faces, if the parents asked for them, and two of them already have, and I didn\\'t think I should be the one to tell them no.\"", "alt": "For the faces, if the parents ask, and two of them already have, which I would note settles the question of demand."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Could be nothing, two things on one planet are bound to overlap somewhere, bound to, but put your finger where the lines cross, there, and keep it there, and then tell me it's nothing.\"", "alt": "This may be nothing, since two things on one planet are bound to overlap somewhere. I'd ask you to look at where the lines cross, Administrator, and then tell me that it is nothing."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${BOND[t.truth.bond].is(a, b)}. I should've seen it, it was right there on the board, I stood in front of it every day, I was so busy being delighted by it I forgot to be afraid of it.\"", "alt": "${BOND[t.truth.bond].is(a, b)}. I should have seen it, since it was on the board and I walked past it daily, and I was so occupied with what it might yield that I neglected to price what it might cost."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"A parasite that only wants to breed makes you sick, that's the whole point of a parasite, but this makes them ${({ keep: 'well', gift: 'well', curious: 'curious' })[T(s).truth.agenda] || 'busy'}, so it isn't one, or not only, it's steering them at something, and we need to know what before they get there.\"", "alt": "A parasite that only wants to breed makes its host ill, whereas this makes them ${({ keep: 'well', gift: 'well', curious: 'curious' })[T(s).truth.agenda] || 'busy'}, so it is not one, or not only, and I would say it is steering them toward something. We need to know what, Administrator, and I'd prefer to know before they arrive."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Everything they've done since we landed makes sense once you start from there, every single thing, and I could kick myself for not seeing it sooner, because how we must've looked to them, oh, I hate to think.\"", "alt": "Everything they have done since landfall is coherent once one starts from there, and I ought to have seen it sooner, because I can now estimate how we must have appeared to them, and I would describe the appearance as unfavourable."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's the same in every one of them, isn't it, the same pace, the same size, the same everything, so it's one cause, one, and one cause is a thing you can find!\"", "alt": "It is identical in every case, with the same pace and the same size, which means a single cause, and a single cause can be found."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"So give me the pump house for a month, because I'd start with the water.\"", "alt": "I require the pump house for a month, and nobody else in it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's on a long ellipse.\"", "alt": "It follows a long ellipse."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It comes round every few months, and I've got the next one to the night, ${c.months} from now, and that's the lovely thing about an ellipse, it can't be late, it can't change its mind, so whatever it does to people, at least we'll see it coming.\"", "alt": "It returns at intervals of some months, and I have the next one to the night, ${c.months} from now, which I would call an appointment kept by a second moon, and one we can plan around."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I wouldn't call that madness.\"", "alt": "I would not describe that as madness."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Not yet, not until somebody checks it, and I'd really like it to be me, so can we please write every word of it down, with the date, before anyone decides what it is?\"", "alt": "Not yet, not until it has been checked, and I would prefer that the checking be mine. Every word of it should be written down, with the date, before anyone decides what it is."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It went to the lamp.\"", "alt": "It moved toward the lamp."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"By itself, overnight, out of ice older than anything we've got a name for, and I know, I wrote the rule about thawing cores, I know which page it's on, but come and see it first and then read me the rule.\"", "alt": "By itself, overnight, and that ice is older than anything we have a name for. I'd like you to come and examine it, Administrator, because a thing that has waited that long and still moves toward light is either very valuable to us or very expensive, and I can't yet tell you which."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Of course I kept some.\"", "alt": "Naturally I retained a portion."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"You were going to burn the lot. Somebody has to know what it is, and it won't tell anyone who's set it on fire. Look, it's sealed. It's fine, it's... give me a month with it.\"", "alt": "You intended to burn the lot, and nobody learns what a thing is from its ash. It is sealed and the risk is contained, and I would request a month with it, since I regard that as the minimum."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Nobody drew this, nobody, and the joints are right, every brace is where I'd have put it if I'd had a year to think, so somebody knew exactly what they were making, and who, who knows how to do that in their sleep?\"", "alt": "Nobody drew this, and the joints are precise, so someone knew exactly what was being made. I would like to know who, and I'd observe that the question matters more than the frame."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I plotted the whole ridge! Asleep! And it's right, I checked it, every line. Do you see what that means? Because I don't, I really don't.\"", "alt": "I plotted the whole ridge while asleep, and it is correct, which I verified line by line. I'd call that a result before I would call it a concern, though I can't yet say why it works."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"They all point at the same patch of sky, all of them, so whatever made them came from one place, and more than once, which means it has a schedule, no wait, I don't know that, I want to know that.\"", "alt": "They all point to the same patch of sky, so whatever made them came from one place, and more than once, which suggests a schedule. I can't yet say that it does, and I intend to establish it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${t.known ? 'It\\'ll come back. Every few years, the craters say.' : 'The craters out on the plain are layered, see? It\\'s happened before. It\\'ll happen again.'} So either we dig in every time it comes, or we build for it once, and I'd really like to watch it land from somewhere with a very thick roof.\"", "alt": "${t.known ? 'It\\'ll come back. Every few years, the craters say.' : 'The craters out on the plain are layered, see? It\\'s happened before. It\\'ll happen again.'} So either we dig in every time or we build for it once, and I would advise the second, Administrator, with a very thick roof, from beneath which I'd prefer to observe the next arrival."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Something on this world's counting everything alive, everything, and I think we're in the sum, ours too, we're being added up, and I can't decide whether I'm frightened or just very, very curious.\"", "alt": "Something on this world is counting everything alive, ourselves included, and I believe we are in the sum. I can't yet say whether that is a threat or a resource, but I would say it deserves a good deal more attention than it is receiving."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"There's structure in it, there, see, and there again, the same shape at a lower pitch, and that much I'll swear to, but past that I'm guessing, and I'd love to guess out loud if you'll let me.\"", "alt": "There is structure in it, here and again here, and that much I will swear to. Beyond that I'm estimating, and I would say the estimate is worth having."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Faults don't keep time, rock doesn't keep time, so something under ${nm(s)} is keeping it, to the second, and I know I should be frightened and what I actually am is dying to see it.\"", "alt": "Faults don't keep time and rock doesn't keep time, so something under ${nm(s)} is keeping it, to the second. I would note that a thing which keeps time can be measured, and a thing that can be measured can be used."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"That's a warning, and a kind one, I think, no, I'm sure, they stood there and waited until somebody came out and looked, who does that for strangers, they wanted us to understand!\"", "alt": "That is a warning, and a courteous one. They stood and waited until someone came out and looked, which is expensive behaviour toward strangers, so I would say they wished us to understand, and I'd advise that we do."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Something in it's doing arithmetic, slowly, across a whole continent, and I've ruled out growth and I've ruled out weather, so does it know we're here, I don't know, I need to find out.\"", "alt": "Something in it is performing arithmetic, slowly, across a continent. I have excluded growth and weather, Administrator, and I would like to establish whether it knows we are here, which I can't do from where I stand."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's a question, I'm nearly sure it's a question, asking what, no idea, but look how it's stopped, it's waiting, it's got all the time in the world, and I'd very much like to be the one who answers it.\"", "alt": "It is a question, I'm fairly confident, though I cannot say what it asks. It has stopped, which means it is waiting and has no deadline, and I would like to be the one who answers it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${Dn(s)} is giving us back what we give it, hit it and it hits back exactly that hard, no harder, I've checked the numbers twice, and I can't find any anger in it anywhere, which is either a comfort or the worst thing I've ever read.\"", "alt": "${Dn(s)} is returning what we give it, and if we hit it, it hits back exactly as hard, no harder, which I've checked twice. I find no anger in it, and I'd note that this is the more useful result, since a thing without anger can be bargained with."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Four metres in a month! That's not a warm year, that's the whole sheet letting go, and when it goes it comes straight down this valley, and I know I shouldn't be this thrilled, but we've got months, and I can show you exactly where it goes.\"", "alt": "Four metres in a month, Administrator. That isn't a warm year but the whole sheet letting go, and when it goes it comes down this valley. We have months, and I can show you exactly where it goes, which is the useful part."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"If they work, they eat from the same ladle as the rest of us, and that's only fair. Where they go is yours to say, and I'd say it slow, because they're green yet.\"", "alt": "Same ladle as everybody, the new hands too, and I'll fill theirs myself and fill it to the top, since they're working! Where they go on the roster is yours to say."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Four's gone and five's on the turn, and with no cold room and no jars it'll rot faster than we can eat it. We eat the soft grain first, all of us, or it goes back to the ground and does nobody any good.\"", "alt": "Bin four's gone and five's going, and with no cold room and no jars it spoils faster than we can eat it, I've never been so outrun by a sack of wheat in my life! So the soft grain goes in the pot first, at every table including mine, or nobody eats it at all."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"The ground's alive, I'll give it that, I've had my hands in it.\"", "alt": "The ground's alive, I put my whole hand in it and it came up warm."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's full of something, and whatever it is, our wheat can't live alongside it.\"", "alt": "It's full of something, and there isn't one thing living in it that our wheat could sit down to supper with."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Nine generations it took, off this ground and nothing else, and nobody gave us this one, so it's ours.\"", "alt": "Nine generations of it, and every one of them grew up in this dirt! Nobody handed us this wheat, we made it, and I'm going to bake the first loaf so big it needs its own bench."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"There's twenty seats, and whoever comes down eats from the first day, and whoever stays up sleeps in a bank the ship can't vouch for any more. I'd not promise anybody a second window, because I don't know that there is one.\"", "alt": "Twenty seats, and whoever comes down eats from the first day, I'll have a pot on before the dust settles! Whoever stays up there sleeps in a bank the ship can't vouch for any more, and Dalia's in that bank, so I won't promise anybody a second window, not even her."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"There's two months left in the bins, and less than that if folk work hard enough to get hungry, and they'll have to.\"", "alt": "Two months in the bins, and less if folk work hard enough to get hungry, and I'm not dressing that one up for anybody."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Nothing we put in the ground feeds anyone this season, if it comes up at all, so somebody goes short. I'd sooner it was all of us, but it's yours to pick, and yours to pick whether we say it out loud.\"", "alt": "Nothing we plant feeds anyone this season, if it even comes up, so somebody goes short. I'd sooner it was all of us, with me at the back of the line, but you pick, and you pick whether we say it out loud in the hall."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"There's about half a month of meat in that room, God forgive me for counting it. I've moved every other column I've got, and this is the last one, and I didn't want to be the one to say it.\"", "alt": "There's about a fortnight of meat in that room, and I've moved every other column in the ration book twice looking for a way round it, and this is the one I didn't want to read out."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"If we're going to pick, we pick now, while the ones we pick have still got the strength in them to work, and I'm sorry I ever did the sum.\"", "alt": "If we're going to pick, we pick now, while the ones we pick can still work, and I hate that I've done the sum, and done it again hoping it'd come out different."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"One flight a month and ten pods a flight, and on paper nobody goes hungry again so long as the lander flies. I'm telling you it adds up, and that's all I'm telling you.\"", "alt": "One flight a month, ten pods, and on paper nobody goes hungry again so long as the lander flies, and you know me, I'd promise that in the hall tonight. I'm only telling you it adds up, I'm not telling you I like it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They eat what a digger eats, and I won't say more than that, except how many days the rest of us get if they don't. I'll not be the one who reads the names out.\"", "alt": "They eat what a digger eats, and that's all I'll say about that list, which you'll agree is a first for me, except how long the rest of us last if they don't."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Nobody ever set the terms, so we could, and I've written them out: half rations, their own compound, no vote till the debt's clear, and the date for that left blank. Twenty of them would dig what we can't, and they'd wake up owing us, and I don't like how easy it was to write.\"", "alt": "Nobody ever set the terms, so we could set them, and here's the shape of it: half rations, a compound of their own, no vote till the debt's clear, and nothing written down about when that is. Twenty of them would dig what we can't and wake up owing us, and I'll tell you now, I'd be the one passing bread over their fence at night."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"That's a third of the seed, and if we burn it, it's gone. If we sow it, the mould goes in the ground with it, and ground doesn't give a thing back once it's got it.\"", "alt": "That's a third of the seed, and I carried every packet of it out of the vault myself. Burn it and it's gone, sow it and the mould's in the ground for good, and I've stood here so long looking for a third way that somebody brought me a chair."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Some'll die whichever way we do it, so it's how many, and whether the ones that live teach us anything about this ground.\"", "alt": "Some of them will die whichever way, and I've gone and named half the trays, which my mother always said was the mistake with goats! What matters is how many, and whether we learn anything from it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Folk are dead on their feet, and the old rule was a day of rest for a reason, so let them sleep it.\"", "alt": "People are dead on their feet, my friend, so let them sleep, and I'll go round with soup for anybody who can't, and sing to the ones who still can't after that."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Sow it all and we're eating our own bread in a season, if the ground will take it. If it won't, that's the seed gone, and there isn't any more of it anywhere.\"", "alt": "Sow it all and we're eating our own bread in a season, I can smell it already, I can taste the crust! And if the ground won't take it, that's the seed gone and there isn't any more, so you'll remember I said that part too, with my mouth full."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Stores'll last ${foodDays(s) < LF.MONTH ? 'less than a month' : LF.monthsWord(foodDays(s) / LF.MONTH)} at this rate.\"", "alt": "Stores'll last ${foodDays(s) < LF.MONTH ? 'less than a month' : LF.monthsWord(foodDays(s) / LF.MONTH)} at this rate, and I've looked under every sack in the place for a joke to put on that, and there isn't one."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It wants glass, or heat, or both, because nothing comes up out of doors here without them.\"", "alt": "Glass or heat, or both, and I'd take either one with a bow on it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"We haven't enough of either, so whichever way you do it, somebody's bunk goes cold this winter.\"", "alt": "We haven't enough of either, so somebody's bunk goes cold whichever way we do it, and the first one to go cold is mine, I've got the padding for it!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Everything grows here, and ours does too, only slower.\"", "alt": "Everything grows here, everything, I turned my back and something came up in my boot!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Turn your back on it a few mornings and it's their harvest, not ours.\"", "alt": "Ours grows too, only slower, and leave it a week and it's their harvest and not ours, and I didn't come all this way to cook for the weeds."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's in three pods, maybe four, and I'll know which when I've been through the last of them.\"", "alt": "It's in three pods, maybe four, I've had my nose in every one of them."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I won't tell you how much is still food till it's sorted, because I'd only be guessing, and you'd plan on the guess.\"", "alt": "I can't tell you how much of it's still food till it's sorted, so I'll be down in the grain with a lamp till it is, and somebody bring me a sandwich."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Three bays showing.\"", "alt": "Three bays showing, and one of them's the bay with the good flour, of course it is!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Could be thirty sacks. Could be all of it. Won't know till they're open.\"", "alt": "Could be thirty sacks, could be all of it, and I won't know till they're open, so I've been lifting lids like a man at a wake hoping the dead one sits up."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I\\'ll do the work. Tell me which work.\"", "alt": "I\\'ll do the work, gladly, I\\'ll do two people\\'s work and eat for three, only tell me which work."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They're scared when they wake.\"", "alt": "They\\'re scared when they wake, every one of them, they come up out of that cold like they\\'ve been somewhere and didn\\'t want to leave."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I sit with them. That's all.\"", "alt": "So I sit with them and talk about soup till their hands stop shaking, and if that doesn\\'t do it I talk about my mother\\'s soup, which works on anybody, and that\\'s all I do."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I can move where it lands, but it costs somebody whichever way I do it, and I won't pretend it doesn't. You'll have to say who goes short, and I'll write it down the way you say it.\"", "alt": "I can move where it lands, but it costs somebody whichever way I do it, and I'm sorry to put that in your lap, my friend, when I'd sooner put a bowl there. You'll have to say who goes short."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They're not wrong that it's something, and I've prayed over it same as they have.\"", "alt": "Well, they're not wrong that it's something, I'll give them that much and a biscuit."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"But they've made it a promise to them in particular, and I've farmed long enough to know the ground doesn't promise anybody anything.\"", "alt": "But they've decided it's a promise made to them personally, and nothing out here has made a promise to anyone, and believe me, I'd know, I've made enough of them for the whole valley."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It knew who'd be up before they knew it themselves, and I'd like to hear it say how.\"", "alt": "It knew who'd be up before they knew it themselves, and I'd like to hear it say how, because I've been doing that roster since we landed and I still put two cooks on the same morning!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I'd never have picked ${c.first} for it, and I was wrong, and I'm glad of it.\"", "alt": "I'd never have picked ${c.first} for it! I'll be eating those words at supper, with salt."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"That's fuel I can barely find, and you know why: ${LF.because(s, c.k)}. But if you say so I'll find it, and I won't grudge them a drop.\"", "alt": "I can barely find that fuel, and you know why: ${LF.because(s, c.k)}. But say the word and I'll find it, I'll go through every shed on my hands and knees and come back with half of it down my shirt."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Something has to change.\"", "alt": "Something has to change, and I don't mean the menu."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Something big enough that they feel it. I've heard three ideas. You won't like any of them.\"", "alt": "Something big enough that they feel it! I've heard three ideas, and I'm not saying who from, though one of them was said with a mouthful of my bread, and you won't like any of them."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's equal shares and we all go weak together, or somebody decides who eats. I'll do the sums for you, but I won't do that part, not for you or anybody.\"", "alt": "Equal shares, and we all go weak together, or somebody decides who eats, and I'll do the sums for either one but I won't do that last part."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I've farmed bad ground before, salt ground, and I know what bad ground does.\"", "alt": "I've farmed bad ground, salt ground, ground with forty thousand people waiting at the edge of it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Bad ground doesn't change its mind about you inside a season, and this has, so it isn't the ground.\"", "alt": "Ground doesn't change its mind about you in a season, it never did in Sfax and it never did at home, and this one did."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's dead out there, all of it, I've walked it.\"", "alt": "It's dead out there, I went and knocked and nobody's home."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"That's what we asked for, and I wouldn't go back to it now and ask for a harvest as well.\"", "alt": "Well, that's what we asked for, and I wouldn't go asking it for a harvest on top, I've pushed my luck with soil before and it pushed me straight back into the mud!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They're right, and I'd have put my own tools down beside theirs.\"", "alt": "They're right, and I told them so, standing at the gate with the pot going cold."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I can't ask them again, and somebody's got to go out there or there's no winter in the store, but I won't be the one who chooses who.\"", "alt": "I can't ask them again, I just can't, and somebody's got to go out there or there's no winter in the store, and I won't be the one who picks who."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"A thing that hunts has a bed.\"", "alt": "A thing that hunts has a bed somewhere, everything does, even me."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"You find the bed. We did it with foxes at home. I'll be back for the sowing.\"", "alt": "You find the bed, that's how we did the foxes at home, my uncle Tarek with the lamp and me making the noise, and I'll be back for the sowing, I swear it on the seed."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Beasts know things before we do, and my father's cows always lay down before the weather.\"", "alt": "Beasts know things, I've always said so, and nobody ever listens to me."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"So I'd find out what they know before we do anything at all.\"", "alt": "Find out what they know before we do a thing, because I've never met a goat yet that was wrong about the weather."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"The ${c.top}'s poor here, thin and sour, I've had it in my hand.\"", "alt": "The ${c.top}'s poor here, thin as a camp soup."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It'll be a season before the fields are what they were, and we'll go short till then, but we'll manage.\"", "alt": "It'll take a season to make the fields what they were, but we'll manage, and I'll throw a feast at the first sowing, you watch me, a feast out of nothing at all!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Those are people's names she's reading, and every one of them eats at our table.\"", "alt": "They're people, my friend, every one of them, and I've fed every one of them."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"You don't send people up to her like a crate of seed, not while I've got a say.\"", "alt": "You don't send people up to her like a crate of beans, and I've loaded enough crates of beans to know the difference!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"The struck all sleep in the low rows, every one of them, I've been round and asked.\"", "alt": "The struck all sleep in the low rows, I know because I've been carrying their suppers down there."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"So I'd take everyone up the hill for the week, and the low rows can stand empty till it's past.\"", "alt": "I've been round every one of them with a pot, and I'm telling you, take everyone up the hill for the week, blankets and all, and I'll cook up there."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Book's right. Every line. My hand, and I wasn't there for it. I don't hold with signing for work I didn't do.\"", "alt": "The book's right, every line of it, in my own hand, and I wasn't even there, I was asleep, I snore, half the rows can tell you! I don't hold with signing for work I didn't do, though I'd happily sign for somebody else's dinner."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"All of them in the same minute, and I've never seen a thing like it, not in people and not in anything that grows.\"", "alt": "All of them in the same minute, like a pot coming to the boil all at once, and I've never seen anything like it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"The ground's richer than it's ever been, so the question is what we put in it, now we know this world keeps count of what we take.\"", "alt": "The ground's richer than it's ever been, I could plant a spoon and dig up a ladle! The question is what we put in it, now that we know the world keeps count."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's a different valley now, warmer and wetter and richer than it was, and nothing we learned farming the old one holds here. We'll learn it again the slow way, because there isn't another.\"", "alt": "It's a different valley now, warmer and wetter with richer soil, and not one thing we learned farming the old one holds here, so we're all apprentices again, and me in the biggest apron."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"There are hands for one of these and not for both, so pick one, and I'll have the roster changed before supper.\"", "alt": "We've got hands for one of these and not for both, and I'd like you to choose it with me, so tell me which, and I'll have the roster changed and the crews told before supper."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"We've got one dish and it points one way, so it's the ship or the sky, and I want it on the ship.\"", "alt": "We've got one dish and it points one way, so it's the ship or the sky, and I'd like it on the ship, because the folks down here and the folks up there need to hear each other's news."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It was half a door, and that was a forty-knot crosswind.\"", "alt": "Half a door, Jeremy, and that was a forty-knot crosswind, so if you're telling it, tell it right."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"You rebuilt the other half crooked, and I checked it the day we left, and it was still crooked.\"", "alt": "And you rebuilt the other half crooked, and I went and looked at it the day we left, and it was still crooked, I'm sorry, Jeremy, but it was."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"We eat up here and we talk shop, and nobody in that line wants us counting what's on their tray.\"", "alt": "I like us eating up here, because it's the one hour we talk shop straight, and I'm not sure the folks in that line want us looking at their trays either."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"You've got ten minutes on this, and then I want the reactor report.\"", "alt": "Give me ten minutes on this, Andrea, and then I'd like the reactor report, and we'll come back to it tomorrow if you're not done."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"There are nine names in that, and I'll have it back now.\"", "alt": "Those are nine of our people in there, and I'd like it back now, please."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"One supper, then, and I\\'ll read it out myself.\"", "alt": "All right, one supper, then, and I'll read it out myself, every name."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Thank you, and that\\'s the last time it leaves my pocket.\"", "alt": "Thank you. I'll read them out myself one day, I promise you that, just not yet."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"The rota's two years up and then under, and you signed it, so you go under at the end of the month like everyone else.\"", "alt": "Mac, the rota's two years up and then under, and you signed it, same as the rest of us, so I'll need you under at the end of the month like everyone else."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"So am I, every time that lid comes down, and I\\'ve gone under every time it was my turn.\"", "alt": "So am I, Mac, every time that lid comes down, and I've gone under every time it was my turn, and I'll be standing right there when it's yours."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's faster, and the roster's never run quicker.\"", "alt": "It's faster, I'll give them that, the roster's never run quicker."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"I see two headings from here, and there isn't a third.\"", "alt": "I can see two ways from here, and I've looked hard for a third, and there isn't one."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Jeremy, the night shift in the sick bay hasn't slept properly in a month, and not one of them has complained, which is exactly why I'm complaining for them.\"", "alt": "Jeremy, the night shift in the sick bay has been charting doses on broken sleep for a month without one word of complaint, which in my experience is the stage just before the mistakes start."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're the ones holding people's hands at three in the morning, so that tin is theirs.\"", "alt": "They're the ones on the ward at three in the morning, which is when people tend to die, so the tin goes to them, and I'll call it a clinical measure if that helps you let go of it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Jane, they want to see us in the line with a tray like everybody else, and I've heard it from half the people who've been through my sick bay this year.\"", "alt": "Jane, half the people who've been through the sick bay this year have asked me why the officers eat behind a hatch, and I've come to think it's a question about what we're eating."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's only eating what they're eating, and I don't know what it costs you to give them that.\"", "alt": "What they're really asking is whether there's a second ration book, and the cheapest way to answer that is to stand in the line with a tray."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You want to put something you dug out of a soil core into an open leg, and the fitter on the end of that leg asked me this morning whether they'll be walking by the end of the year.\"", "alt": "You'd like to put something out of a soil core into an open leg, and the fitter on the end of it asked me this morning whether they'd be walking by the end of the year, which is a question about the leg and not about your fungus."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"In my sick bay, on somebody who'd like to keep both of them, so you ask them first, not me.\"", "alt": "If it gets past the dead part it's in the blood, in my sick bay, on somebody who'd like to keep both legs, so the one to ask first is the fitter, and the one to ask second is me."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not well enough to move, and the one with the crushed hand still goes white every time somebody knocks the bed.\"", "alt": "They're not well enough to move, and the crushed hand goes white every time somebody knocks the bed, which tells me more than the chart does."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'm glad you sit with them, Samuel, I am, but your bay isn't clean, and I'm not putting a fever in among the greens.\"", "alt": "Sitting with them does them good, Samuel, I'll grant you that much, but your bay isn't clean, and one fever among the greens and I've lost the patients and the greens together."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Somebody's going to get hurt out in the spine one day, Nolan, and it'll be your lot carrying them to me, and I'd like there to be some blood left in them when they get here.\"", "alt": "Somebody's going to get hurt out in the spine one day, Nolan, and your lot will carry them to me, and whether they arrive as a patient or as paperwork depends on the first few minutes, which are yours."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Those are nine people the others knew, Jane, and they've a right to hear the names said.\"", "alt": "Those are nine people the others knew, Jane, and I'd say the others have more right to the names than the notebook has."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Wake them for one supper and read it out loud, all of it, because they're not yours to carry on your own.\"", "alt": "Wake them for one supper and read it out loud, all of it, since grief kept alone in a notebook goes bad the way a wound does when you keep it covered."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You'll wear that barrel through, Nolan, so put it down and eat something before I have to stitch you up again.\"", "alt": "You'll wear that barrel through, Nolan, and I've stitched you once already, so put it down and eat something and spare me a second set."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You'd put a hot wire to their blood in front of the whole mess, with their children watching.\"", "alt": "A hot wire to their blood in front of the whole mess, with their children watching, and you'd call that a diagnosis."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Whatever this is, it's a child doing it, and a lonely one, who's stopped playing with anybody.\"", "alt": "Whatever this is, a child is doing it, and a lonely one who's stopped playing with anybody, which is the only symptom here I'm sure of."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's three women I've sat with this month, and every one of them asked me what they did wrong.\"", "alt": "That's three women through the clinic this month, and each one asked me what she'd done wrong, and I told each of them nothing, and not one of them believed me."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Whatever they did, they did it on a world that's got no say over them now, and down here they're patients, same as you. I've stitched half of them already, and not one asked me to read their file first.\"", "alt": "Whatever they did, they did on a world that has no say over them now, and down here they're patients, which is a category that includes you. I've stitched half of them already, and I didn't find the crime anywhere I looked."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're fine, they're fed and they're warm, and they don't know yet that anybody gave them back.\"", "alt": "They're fed, they're warm, and they're the healthiest patients in the clinic, and not one of them knows yet that anybody gave them back."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You'll take their eyes over my body, and I mean that. The one with the thumbnail let me clean them this morning and held on to my wrist the whole time, and that's my patient, not the moon's.\"", "alt": "Anyone who takes their eyes will do it over my body, and I mean that literally. The one with the thumbnail let me clean them this morning and held on to my wrist the whole time, and you're not deciding about the moon, you're deciding about my patient."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's a pin, I put pins like that in people every week in Johannesburg, and that hauler hasn't dared sit down to supper since.\"", "alt": "It's a pin, I put pins like that in people every week in Guangzhou, and the only thing a pin has ever spread is the bill for the surgery, and that hauler hasn't dared sit down to supper since."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"There's one cradle, so pick one, and pick the one you'd miss soonest.\"", "alt": "One cradle, boss, one! So pick the one you'd miss soonest, and don't you dare say the kettle."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The reactor's night shift hasn't slept in a month either, and they're the ones keeping the old girl from waking everybody the hard way. It was in my locker, so it's my tin.\"", "alt": "Piss off, the reactor's night shift hasn't slept in a month either, and they're the ones stopping that bastard waking everybody the hard way! It was in my locker, so it's my goddamn tin."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She gets a temper on her round three in the morning, and I'm the one sat up with her when she does, so I've got a temper too.\"", "alt": "That reactor throws a fit every night round three in the morning, and I'm the one sat up under it swearing when it does, so I've got a temper too, and I've earned the coffee!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"This was Kiruna, the old test field, and Jane brings a lander in sideways and takes the hangar door clean off its runners, the whole door, mind. I spent the best part of a month hanging the new one, and nobody bought me so much as a coffee for it.\"", "alt": "Kiruna, the old test field! Jane brings a lander in sideways and takes the whole fucking hangar door off its runners, and I spent the best part of a month hanging the new one to gauge, and nobody bought me so much as a coffee, boss!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's a good pump, and it's a crying waste leaving her sat in a crate going stiff. Give me two days and the parts, three if the line's perished, and she'll water the lot.\"", "alt": "That's a good pump going stiff in a crate, boss, and it's a goddamn crime! Give me two days and the parts, three if the line's perished, and it'll water the lot on a timer, properly."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"You want to put mushroom glue in my reactor, in her, in the old girl, who's never had a thing inside her I didn't make or check myself.\"", "alt": "You want to put mushroom glue in my reactor, boss? I've never let a thing inside that bastard I didn't make or check myself, and you want me to start with a fucking fungus?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Don\\'t you tell Mac I said so, or I\\'ll never hear the end of it.\"", "alt": "Don't you tell Mac I said so, boss, or I'll never hear the bloody end of it!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Nobody, it's the sensors going, same as they did last watch, and I'll get to them once the coolant pump stops whining at me.\"", "alt": "Nobody, you suspicious sod, it's the sensors going same as last watch, and I'll get to them once this coolant pump stops whining at me like a goddamn kettle!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"You count your lights and I listen to my bearings, and between us nothing goes without somebody hearing it, so it's about the same job really.\"", "alt": "You count your lights and I listen to my bearings, and between us nothing goes without somebody shouting about it, so drink that and stop glaring at me."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Forty-five years, about, and that\\'s long enough, just, if I keep my hands on her and nobody gets clever with the throttle.\"", "alt": "Forty-five years, about, boss, and that's just long enough if I keep my hands on it and some clever bastard doesn't get creative with the throttle!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Hm.\"", "alt": "Oh, you sneaky bastard."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Twenty years?\"", "alt": "Twenty years?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The old girl won\\'t last the trip, so I\\'d not be asking her for twenty years on top of it.\"", "alt": "Boss, this ship won't even make the trip unless somebody rebuilds half of it, so I'm not asking it for twenty years on top!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can run a cable to it, and if I've read it right that's the lights on for ten thousand years, give or take. If I've read it wrong, well, I'd rather not be the one holding the cable.\"", "alt": "I can run a cable to it, boss, and if I've read it right that's the lights on for ten thousand years, give or take! If I've read it wrong, I'd like it in the log that somebody else was holding the cable."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"So it walks, then, and it found the tools before it found me.\"", "alt": "So it walks, boss, and it found my tools before it found me, the bastard."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I wouldn't hang a hat on one month, not with what I've seen this stuff do. ${c.mw ? 'Ask me when the old girl\\'s still turning at harvest.' : 'Ask me at harvest.'}\"", "alt": "I wouldn't hang my hat on one month, boss, not after what I've seen this shit do to good steel. ${c.mw ? 'Ask me when the old girl\\'s still turning at harvest.' : 'Ask me at harvest.'}"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's crossed.\"", "alt": "It has crossed with the wild."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Tardigrades! Out of the soil cores, and no, Nolan, they don't eat stew, they don't eat anything, they dry themselves out and wait, which is, hold on, look at that one, it's moving, they'll outlive the ship, they'll outlive all of us.\"", "alt": "They're tardigrades, Mr Edney, out of the soil cores, and they don't eat stew or anything else, since they dry themselves out and wait. That one has resumed moving, which I'd note is the property that makes them worth the jar, because they will outlast the ship and all of us in it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"They've been boiled and frozen and put out in vacuum and they came back every time, so if you ever want guards that can't be killed, Nolan, I've got thousands in here.\"", "alt": "They've survived boiling, freezing and vacuum, and recovered every time, so whatever lets them do it is the most valuable thing on this table. If you ever require guards that can't be killed, Mr Edney, I have several thousand candidates, though I'd want the mechanism before I'd want the guards."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"You can't call a wheat Santa Rosa.\"", "alt": "You can't call a wheat Santa Rosa, Administrator."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"There are four Santa Rosas, Samuel, four, in three countries, and in a year nobody will know which wheat anyone means, a code only ever means the one thing, that's the whole beauty of it.\"", "alt": "There are four Santa Rosas in three countries, Mr Barlow, and in a year nobody will be able to say which wheat the name refers to, whereas a code means one thing only. A name costs us the record, and I'd regard that as too high a price for a village."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It eats dead tissue, only dead, I've had it on a dish with live cells for a month and it'd rather starve than touch them, and it knows the difference better than we do, isn't that beautiful?\"", "alt": "It consumes dead tissue and nothing else, and I've kept it on a dish with living cells for a month, during which it preferred to starve. It distinguishes the two more reliably than our own instruments do, which makes it of considerable use, provided someone is prepared to put it in a leg."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It holds heat, it holds pressure, I've had it boiling for a week, Jeremy, a week, and it doesn't care, it just sits there being rubber, do you know how rare that is in something that grew itself?\"", "alt": "It holds heat and pressure, and I've kept it at the boil for a week, Mr Donadini, without measurable change. A material that grows itself and performs to that standard is rare enough that I'd put its value above the spares it would save, and those are considerable."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"There's a smudge there that isn't on the chart.\"", "alt": "There's an object there that isn't on the chart."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Not in the catalogue, not on last year's plate, nothing, it's just there, and I've been looking at it for an hour and I don't want to stop, isn't that wonderful?\"", "alt": "It appears neither in the catalogue nor on last year's plate, and I've had it under observation for an hour, Administrator. If it's real, it's the first new entry we've made since Earth, and I'd want it measured again tonight before anyone mentions it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Years at a time with the instruments running and nobody reading them, think what goes past while I'm asleep, no, think what we're missing right now, let me stay up through the next watch, one more year, and I'll go under after, I promise I'll go under.\"", "alt": "For years at a time the instruments run and nobody reads them, so everything that passes while I'm asleep is data collected and wasted, and I'd count that as the largest standing loss on this ship. I'd ask to remain up through the next watch for one further year, after which I shall go under as the rota requires."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Mine failed.\"", "alt": "My own sample failed."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Four metres.\"", "alt": "Four metres down, Administrator."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"There's one rover, and it'll do one job this season, so it ought to be the one we'll still be glad of come winter.\"", "alt": "There's one rover, and it'll do one job this season, and I'd love to promise you both, but I can't, so let's have it doing the one we'll still be hugging come winter!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Nobody'll thank you either way, because they taste like the ship, but every pack we eat now is a sack of seed we can put back in the ground.\"", "alt": "Nobody'll thank you either way, they taste like the ship and the ship tasted like a boot, but every pack we eat now is a sack of seed back in the ground, and I'll make them palatable, I swear it, or at least warm."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"We're far enough out that you'd have to say it louder, I'd think, so I'm saying it.\"", "alt": "We're so far out you'd have to shout it, so I'm shouting it, and somebody's listening, even if it's only Dalia through the glass, and she's heard worse from me."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Go on and eat, now, before the stew goes cold.\"", "alt": "Go on and eat, now, all of you, before the stew goes cold and I have to take it personally!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Folk'll remember Santa Rosa, Mac, because somebody grew up there, and nobody ever grew up in TR-114.\"", "alt": "Folk'll remember Santa Rosa, Mac, because somebody grew up there and ate their mother's bread there, and nobody ever got homesick for TR-114!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Roots rot if they sit wet, and that much water all at once will drown the bottom racks before anybody sees it happen.\"", "alt": "Roots rot if they sit wet, I've drowned more lettuce than I've eaten, and that's a lot of lettuce, and that much water all at once will have the bottom racks swimming before anybody sees it happen."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Get them out of here and sit them in the bay under the lamps, where it's warm and smells of something growing, and I'll make a broth with the greens off the racks. My grandmother kept a ward when the water came over the farms, and nobody in it stayed in bed for long.\"", "alt": "Get them out of here and sit them in the bay under the lamps, where it's warm and smells of something growing, and I'll make them a broth with the greens off the racks! In Sfax we put the sick by the cook tent, and nobody stayed sick for long with my soup under their nose."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Or we could ask at supper.\"", "alt": "Or we could just ask at supper, with a full pot on, I've found out worse things that way."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Whoever it is, they're hungry or they're frightened, and either way they'll come and say so if we give them the chance.\"", "alt": "Whoever it is, they're hungry or they're frightened, and either way they'll come and tell me if we give them the chance, because people always do."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's been on somebody's chart since before there were charts, Mac, and you're just the first of us to see it.\"", "alt": "It's been on somebody's chart since before there were charts, Mac, and you're just the first of us lucky enough to see it, so wave at it, and then somebody eat something!"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Dinner and a specimen, lovely, and who signed that jar out of the cold store, Mac? And does whatever's in it eat stew, or does it eat us?\"", "alt": "With respect, Mac, I'd ask who signed that jar out of the cold store, because the galley's mine to keep and I wasn't told. And I'd like to know whether what's in it eats stew, or eats us."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"All right, that\\'s fair, and I\\'ll take it.\"", "alt": "That's fair, and I'll take it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Beaten by a jar, and it held out longer than most I\\'ve had in the lock-up.\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that I was beaten by a jar, and that it held out longer than I would have."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Who's listening out here, Samuel? Nobody, that's who, we left the last church behind at Mars.\"", "alt": "With respect, Samuel, I don't believe anyone's listening this far out, but I'll wait until you've finished."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Two shifts a month off the rounds, and who walks the cryo decks while my lot are learning knots? Nobody does, and that's exactly when the stores go light, I promise you.\"", "alt": "I'd ask who walks the cryo decks for those two shifts a month while my people are learning, because I won't leave a post with nobody on it, and an empty post is when the stores go light."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Knots.\"", "alt": "That was my rota, and that was mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Leave a sack of the good stuff out with dye inside it, and whoever it is glows green for a week, and then we have a chat about who they are and where they were taking it, and I'll be very civil about it.\"", "alt": "I'd ask to sit up in the stores myself with a sack of the good seed marked with dye, so whoever takes it shows green, and then I'll speak to them, politely, about where they were taking it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Forty-one amber, and there were thirty-nine at the last change, so who've we lost, Jeremy, and when exactly were you going to mention it?\"", "alt": "There are forty-one amber now, Jeremy, and there were thirty-nine at the last change, so I'd ask you to tell me plainly whether we've lost anyone, and why I wasn't told."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"If I wear it through I'll have a job for tomorrow, and I'd sooner that than sit here eating while the board does what it likes.\"", "alt": "With respect, Doctor, if I wear it through I'll have a job for the morning, and I'd rather that than sit and eat while the board does as it likes."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely quiet night for it, and I don't trust a minute of it.\"", "alt": "It's a quiet night, and I've logged it as one, but I don't trust it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Thanks for the stitches, doc.\"", "alt": "Thank you for the stitches, Doctor, I should have said so long ago."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"You'll have to pick one, because I've only got the one wall.\"", "alt": "With respect, you'll have to choose one, because I have the one wall and my people on it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Nobody argues with a number, and when the stores go light I'll ask whose number had the key, and for once nobody can tell me they don't remember.\"", "alt": "I'll grant it would show me whose number had the key if the stores go light, but I know who every one of those numbers goes home to, and I'd ask that the names go back up."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Well, that's a body short of what we buried, so who had the burial ground last night?\"", "alt": "First, that's a body short of what we buried. Second, I'd like to know who had the burial ground last night, and I'll check the watch book before I ask anyone."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Not yet, they aren't.\"", "alt": "With respect, they aren't dangerous yet."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It's gone two pods down a pipe in a month under a whole row of sleepers, and not one of them noticed?\"", "alt": "It's gone two pods down a pipe in a month, under a whole row of sleepers, and I'd like to know how not one of them noticed, my people on the night watch included."}
];
